/users/bdiadiun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bdiadiun/artifact-synchronization/commits/520e05727bc098aebb025855fea6bfd573cae6f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T22:14:40Z","email":"b.diadiun@gmail.com","name":"Bohdan Diadiun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T22:14:40Z","email":"b.diadiun@gmail.com","name":"Bohdan Diadiun"},"message":"refactor: a tool yields a list of metrics\n\nThe contract''s METRIC_KEY_BY_TOOL (one metric key per tool) becomes\nMETRIC_KEYS_BY_TOOL, a readonly list per tool. The extension reads the\nlist through two flat tables, UNITS (cornerstone''s spelling to the\ncontract''s unit) and UNIT_FIELD (the cachedStats field holding each\nmetric''s unit), replacing a unit table per metric, a nested spec and\nfour helpers. The form labels a row by the first key of its tool''s list\nand shows every listed metric that arrived; the fallback to the first\nmetric under any key is gone. Decision A-40.\n\nContract 0.1.0, channel 0.0.10, scoring-viewer 0.1.2,\nohif-extension-loader 0.1.2.","tree":{"sha":"351bd54be5104c7e2b75660cc57ed5c4737cef0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bdiadiun/artifact-synchronization/git/trees/351bd54be5104c7e2b75660cc57ed5c4737cef0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bdiadiun/artifact-synchronization/git/commits/520e05727bc098aebb025855fea6bfd573cae6f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89911638?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadi