diun/artifact-synchronization/commits/f21631f6b53d188ba0cd8a82c82176a2027ac66e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:05:46Z","email":"b.diadiun@gmail.com","name":"Bohdan Diadiun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:05:46Z","email":"b.diadiun@gmail.com","name":"Bohdan Diadiun"},"message":"refactor(form): the row model has its own folder\n\n`models/row.ts` is what a row is and how it becomes its neighbours:\n`RowStatus`, the `Row` type and `RowModel` — the JSON form, `create`,\n`toJSON` / `fromJSON`, `toRestoreRequest` — as one named object of plain\nfunctions (A-36). The reducer keeps `FormAction` and the transitions;\nthe rows'' persistence is a service beside the generic storage,\n`services/storedRows.ts`, not state (A-35).","tree":{"sha":"15fe4d13be36629074e21107bc620cd891a0f321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bdiadiun/artifact-synchronization/git/trees/15fe4d13be36629074e21107bc620cd891a0f321"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bdiadiun/artifact-synchronization/git/commits/f21631f6b53d188ba0cd8a82c82176a2027ac66e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89911638?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bdiadiun","id":89911638,"login":"bdiadiun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTExNjM4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bdiadiun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gith