ng_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/d427890c793fe1aeb9e368e96329d8a2ded81ddf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:28:44Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:28:44Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"traversal FX: index-0 texel transparency for object materials\n\nThe traversal sibling of the freefall index-0 fix. get_object_material\nalready writes index-0 texels as alpha 0 in objectTexture_, but\n_object_material never entered the transparent pass — so the texels\nrendered opaque black.\n\nLevel-1 playtest artifacts this resolves:\n- Aircraft/enemy death remnant: the EXPLODE corpse is a 26-frame\n  transparent-surround fireball (60.7% index-0); it rendered as a\n  featureless black sphere.\n- Combat FX sprites: the FIRE burst (83% idx-0) and the SB_*/SL_*\n  blood splats (45-77% idx-0, red index-3) rendered opaque black\n  blobs instead of transparent sprays.\n\nOnly index-0-bearing textures enter the transparent pass (has_alpha);\nopaque geometry textures stay in the depth-writing opaque pass. A\nLEVEL3S.MTI census shows index-0 is confined to FX records (EXPLODE/\nTRAIL/SB_*/SL_*/BUBB/PULSE/FIRE) — no opaque wall/enemy/pickup\ngeometry carries the key, matching the original''s transparent-texel\nfill contract.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5f3a9cb698f7152c4e86209ed5ceee23c4736d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/d5f3a9cb698f7152c4e86209ed5ceee23c4736d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/d427890c793fe1aeb9e368e96329d8a2ded81ddf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/d427890c793fe1aeb9e368e96329d8a2ded81ddf","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGQ0Mjc4OTBjNzkzZmUxYWViOWUzNjhlOTYzMjlkOGEyZGVkODFkZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/2a08e71b186a302b303473f3d3bf5be1eb922e90","sha":"2a08e71b186a302b303473f3d3bf5be1eb922e90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/2a08e71b186a302b303473f3d3bf5be1eb922e90"}],"sha":"d427890c793fe1aeb9e368e96329d8a2ded81ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/d427890c793fe1aeb9e368e96329d8a2ded81ddf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/2a08e71b186a302b303473f3d3bf5be1eb922e90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:10:38Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:10:38Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"L1 playtest repair: freefall artifacts + pacing + mover fixes\n\nOwner playtest found mode-2 presentation artifacts and a Level-1\nprogression blocker; this lands the evidence-verified repairs.\n\nFreefall (Phase D):\n- Remove the spurious kind-1 pickup marker. +0x10c is a relocated\n  sprite-source pointer populated only by the traversal/load fixup\n  (FUN_00426f34, 0x42xxxx callers); spawned objects get +0x10c=0\n  from the zeroed alloc and no spawn/tick writes it, so the marker\n  never draws in the original. The cream square was the PICK\n  sprite''s opaque 0xff border. Pickups render as the kind-2\n  medallion alone, matching the AVI.\n- Transparent-texel fix: index 0 is the texture fill''s transparent\n  key (the EXPLODE fireball is a transparent-surround sprite, 93%\n  index 0; all model textures are opaque). Only index-0-bearing\n  textures enter the transparent pass — the hit explosion now\n  renders a translucent fireball instead of an opaque faceted dome.\n\nTiming (Phase A): pace mode 2/3 sim stepping at ~30Hz wall time —\nthe original contract is one step per dispatcher tick, so a\n60/120Hz display ran the world 2-4x fast.\n\nLevel-1 progression (Phase B/C): rebuild the mover transform/world\nAABB at the FUN_0045612c tail so descending pickups (the DANT_1\nnuke) are collectable, and dispatch mover special-cases on the\ntable-1 entry name (SW_H150) rather than the geometry name —\nrestores the I Feel Top flee/collect path.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"06897c8a5808703b347a22245b403a4ed07717ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/06897c8a5808703b347a22245b403a4ed07717ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/2a08e71b186a302b303473f3d3bf5be1eb922e90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://ap