m/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/c1d37ced72b38523c65d418ac05e034752191ac0","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGMxZDM3Y2VkNzJiMzg1MjNjNjVkNDE4YWMwNWUwMzQ3NTIxOTFhYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/1adb15bbe2f65ad6ed332900c670d038838b2bdd","sha":"1adb15bbe2f65ad6ed332900c670d038838b2bdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/1adb15bbe2f65ad6ed332900c670d038838b2bdd"}],"sha":"c1d37ced72b38523c65d418ac05e034752191ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/c1d37ced72b38523c65d418ac05e034752191ac0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/1adb15bbe2f65ad6ed332900c670d038838b2bdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:38:05Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:38:05Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"traversal: remove invented L3 auto sphere transit\n\nMASKED_SEGMENT_1_REASSESSMENT disproved the scripted-ride model:\nthe masked window is a stationary manual sniper-scope session —\nBUILD_A''s only c9c writer is the input-gated FUN_00465228 path,\nKurt never leaves (-4,0,190), and the three non-spawn waypoints\nhave no original-data provenance.\n\n- delete player_sphere.{h,cpp} (kSpherePath, sphereSeqEnter,\n  playerSphereArm/Step/PostStep) — no authentic consumer remains\n- drop spherePhase/sphereTimer/sphereDist from TraversalRuntime\n  and sphereRideActive from TraversalFrameResult\n- remove the fresh-load arm, the pre-dispatch position drive, and\n  the post-dispatch dismount from stepTraversalRuntime\n- retarget the mdk-inspect diagnostic to the real scope fields\n  (c9c/ca0/zoom) instead of the fake phase/dist\n- player_reticle.h: drop the stale sphere-ride comment\n\nP0-E is removed from the functional-blocker set as an invalid\nrequirement, not a regression. Verified on real LEVEL3 data:\nidle 310f holds (-4,0,190) with c9c/ca0 silent; --press 57@20\n(snipe edge) -> c9c=1, event 0x323, ca0 1->3, zoom 2.4->1.0;\nweapon-5 fires ammo 30->27 through the normal dispatch;\n--press 57@1100 unscopes to on-foot traversal at the same pos.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"041dec6db698c8e394b6d69b82f6fe9acfbb4c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/041dec6db698c8e394b6d69b82f6fe9acfbb4c25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/1adb15bbe2f65ad6ed332900c670d038838b2bdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gis