//api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/679c73a3a79d4e92becb6ceb08808583c5e493de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T19:12:51Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T19:12:51Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"traversal: P1 batch-3 — portal carrier fix + QA spawn provenance\n\n- Portal crossing now stores the DEPARTED arena in the partner slot\n  (ca4 <- old c48) so connector transit keeps the old arena\n  collision live; previous code bound the destination instead,\n  contradicting OBSERVED disassembly at 0x4363a1..0x4363be.\n- boxTri: split into core + MDK_BT_TRACE wrapper (QA-only trace of\n  the +a0 inside-face crossing path used for the L4/L8 divergence\n  proof); no behaviour change.\n- Spawn log records the executing object + CMI instruction offset\n  (QA-only provenance for per-arena spawn audits).\n- mdk_inspect: arena/portal/connect dumps + QA route options used\n  for the Level-3 corridor investigation.\n\nCorridor finding (LEVEL3_P1_GAP_REPORT.md section 15, local-only\nunder out/): all CHMO_* arenas carry zero collision and only\ntrigger/portal records — the connector lane has no walkable floor;\ntransit must be scripted/vehicle. The mechanism that arms a\nmid-level masked ride is UNKNOWN (next: exe-side 0x540cac writers,\n0x83 cinematic family).","tree":{"sha":"4f825b0cd7a2cdb6f1f7ca51985e876bbfdf7ee6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/4f825b0cd7a2cdb6f1f7ca51985e876bbfdf7ee6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/679c73a3a79d4e92becb6ceb08808583c5e493de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com