0x9f fxSpawn, 0x9d named-slot, 0xb6 var-loop.\n\nArena VM: 0x59 sfxBind, 0x87 camera-shake floor, 0x88/0x8a/0x8b FX\nemits. Shared-table fallback: arena-unowned ops dispatch through\nobjScriptInsn against eventLatch with bidirectional\nTraversalScriptState <-> DynamicObject mirroring (PC, wait pair,\nmarks, locals, flags, 4-deep call stack) — matching the original''s\nsingle-table shape. Orig-dead ops still kill.\n\nDisassembler: +20 grammars incl. kind-cmp/linkage tails; 0xba \"v\"\nmode-dependent fix. Dynamic: 19-arena sweep diag=0 except HMO_9''s\nverified-match 0x8d kill; ride leg insn 151859->159431, diag=0.\nL4-L8 goldens byte-exact; freefall unchanged; L3 golden remains\nsuperseded (recorded, not overwritten).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2095341369704a1e4906495b09484ad02f3c5680","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/2095341369704a1e4906495b09484ad02f3c5680"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/f692ec6d5854f6dd3da031ebb77c4ba93f613a23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/s