21:25:42Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"sphere ride: the L3 scripted vehicle segment (P0-E)\n\nImplements the automatic sphere entry the oracle shows ~0.7 s after\nthe HMO_1 spawn (SPHERE_ENTRY.md — OBSERVED: no locomotion precedes\nthe masked view; ladder x0 -> x22 -> x50+ over the ~35.7 s window;\nscripted dismount into a walled alcove). MDK95.EXE analysis puts the\nmechanism in the scripted-sequence state (ae0a0 mode-2 transition ->\nmode-3 vehicle loop) — CORROBORATED; no pod object exists in the\noriginal f10/f200 save object lists, so the ride is a scripted\nsegment sharing the class-4 mount dword + reticle channels, not an\nobject mount.\n\n- playerSphereArm at fresh level-3 load only (save/diag starts are\n  not the fresh-entry path); phase 1 = the on-foot window while the\n  normal dispatch still runs.\n- Phase 2 owns the dispatch like fieldDa0''s takeoff: scripted path\n  pad -> canyon descent -> door 117-1 -> alcove pad, reticle channel\n  block (accelChannel + \"/3\" mouse + clamps), semi-auto fire latch,\n  ladder recharge; dismount places Kurt on-foot at the pad.\n- HUD: center reticle + right-edge \"x N\" ladder under phase 2.\n- Endpoints evidence-bound; interior waypoints + ammo cap/rate are\n  HYPOTHESIS — flagged in player_sphere.h.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2605c403d1cc7dce7f0a06ad83d5a78c1c245c9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/2605c403d1cc7dce7f0a06ad83d5a78c1c245c9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/7dcd86d70f89dc46ee3dc981da75ceeae495482c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://ap