pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/09b88b4ee61d41b8ce0ddecc223cc13241d32e4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:25:34Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T21:25:34Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"script VM: port opcodes 0x1d + 0x22 + 0x31 (chain links)\n\nThe chain-member family the LEVEL3 HMO_1 XE''s class script uses for\nits four XG gun pods:\n\n- 0x1d (CreateChain, 0x43f9aa) — {u8 count, lstr class, u32 scOff}:\n  class-table lookup, then count children onto the arena list with\n  +0x138 = leader and +0x146 = remaining-generation index descending;\n  a class miss logs \"CreateChain %s not found\" and exits the pass.\n- 0x22 (leaderless link, 0x43fe82) — {linkage}: gates on +0x138 == 0,\n  the \"am I attached\" test the chain members run.\n- 0x31 (releaseChain, 0x447042) — {u8 n, linkage}: n iterations detach\n  the max-+0x146 member (+0x138/+0x11e cleared); a miss applies the\n  linkage mid-loop and the interpreter continues at the new pc.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"655c7fb7dba471e74f5e8724b929ab48ded79c7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/655c7fb7dba471e74f5e8724b929ab48ded79c7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/09b88b4ee61d41b8ce0ddecc223cc13241d32e4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com