i.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/5bd35dce62e9e849db25a3120359257dca570ca1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:37:23Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:37:23Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"script VM: port opcodes 0xd0 + 0xf8 (P0-D)\n\n0xd0 (handler 0x450a48) — the element-mask conditional linkage:\n{lstr name, linkage}; FUN_0045c0f0 resolves the name against the\nbound object''s element records (+0x1c count / +0x20 array, exact\nstreq — no \"ALL\" wildcard) and tests the bit in +0x2c8 (elemMaskB).\nGate-true: fc/fe call a, fd return, all else goto a; gate-false:\nfe calls b. This is the XS boss''s destroyed-part check (LEVEL3\nHMO_1$XS XS1_SHOL/SHOR/EYES at +6187/+61bb) — the audit''s halt site.\n\n0xf8 (handler 0x448a86) — the enemy melee strike against Kurt:\n{u8 mode, f32 a, [f32 b], f32 c}. mode==0 shoves in the object''s\nyaw frame via FUN_00437f98 (+0x4c); mode!=0 shoves radially away\n(zero dist -> +x unit). Planar components scale by 1/30 into\n0x540e44/48; c adds unscaled to 0x540c78. Writes locoState=0x385\nand eventPriority=9 directly; gated by 0x540cbc>=9 /\n0x540cac==0x320; unscopes 0x540c9c first (FUN_00461878 — which\nclears the latch so a scoped hit still lands) and kills the\n0x540c74 fire latch + the FUN_00469668(0) HUD pair.\n\nLive verification on LEVEL3 real data:\n- XS object script runs 1000+ frames, diag=0 (was: halt op 0xf8\n  at +5a57 / op 0xd0 at +6187).\n- Melee chain fires on touch: 6d dmg 5 -> hp 150->145, tumble\n  0x385, e10 suppress window, f8 knockback pushes Kurt out of the\n  touch volume (touchLink then correctly stops gating).\n- Unit tests cover gate/linkage modes, radial+yaw impulse math,\n  the suppression gates, fire-latch kill, unscope ordering and\n  disasm decode: 583434 checks, 0 failures.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"227c0ac9ef9d881912f05ae17916ed9725bf09e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/227c0ac9ef9d881912f05ae17916ed9725bf09e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/5bd35dce62e9e849db25a3120359257dca570ca1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/5bd35dce62e9e849db25a3120359257dca570ca1","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDViZDM1ZGNlNjJlOWU4NDlkYjI1YTMxMjAzNTkyNTdkY2E1NzBjYTE","parents":[{"html_