4\n  {1,8,9} gates, then grounded+still posts event 0x325/8 so the\n  dispatcher enters locoState 0x325 (K_SPWEP) — the FUN_00461954\n  frame-8 crossing then fires the anim-timed throw — while the\n  airborne states 0x2bd/2be/2bf spawn immediately.\n- FUN_0046a190: resolves the item name through the enemy table,\n  spawns the object at player pos +4z with flags 0x818a6 and\n  +0x30a = item id (cmdBody<id>), throws it at 25 u/s (3x for\n  SW_HBOMB, no vertical toss in chute), arms DUMMY''s anim fields,\n  extends SEAL/SBONE to 750 ticks, decrements the charge and\n  removes the slot at 0 via inventoryRemove.\n\nmdk-inspect gains --itemuse FRM (key-edge 28 injection) to drive\nthe real input path on Level-3 data: airborne throw and the\ngrounded K_SPWEP->frame-8 throw both verified end-to-end with\ncharge decrement; empty inventory and id6 reject as observed.\n\nItem census written to\nout/playthrough-reference/2026-10-05_canonical/ITEM_CENSUS.md.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ffaa499140711132a9de372575f60305ec01970","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/5ffaa499140711132a9de372575f60305ec01970"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/67035a6d4bb0665c8a78e580b0c28971ccd943a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.gith