b.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/b91799b1cb0e63785a6d7125e7bff42a0bccda56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:23:57Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:23:57Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"godot bridge: fix mode-6 smoke regressions found by §6 test sweep\n\nTwo real bugs surfaced running the full pytest suite with\nMDK_GODOT_BIN set (previously all 16 Godot tests skipped):\n\n- ff_veil_mask() crashed (signal 11) when the host asked for the\n  §4C mask before the first freefallSceneVeilMask build — the\n  member''s recs/counts vectors were still empty. Sized at\n  freefallInit in both entry paths and guarded in the pack loop.\n\n- frontend_progression_step sent stage_done/confirm nowhere in\n  mode 6: the briefing machine only consumed any_key/esc/hurry, so\n  the campaign pump could never complete the stage. stage_done now\n  rides the briefing''s own esc/skip arm (instant page fill + exit\n  key at the hold gate — its real proceed-fast path) and confirm\n  counts as a genuine key press (anyKey). The campaign smoke''s\n  pump budget moves 12 -> 60 to match the machine''s real duration\n  (0.5s fade-in + fill + key + 0.5s fade-out ~= 31 pumps).\n\npytest tests/: 33 passed, 0 skipped, 0 failed (all targets real).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bdffbc40dbec25d8bb57cc53adfdf6c74b667f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/7bdffbc40dbec25d8bb57cc53adfdf6c74b667f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/b91799b1cb0e63785a6d7125e7bff42a0bccda56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/b91799b1cb0e63785a6d7125e7bff42a0bccda56","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGI5MTc5OWIxY2IwZTYzNzg1YTZkNzEyNWU3YmZmNDJhMGJjY2RhNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/7daf379ed65e5591fc02406659f7b84f9d04a0d8","sha":"7daf379ed65e5591fc02406659f7b84f9d04a0d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/7daf379ed65e5591fc02406659f7b84f9d04a0d8"}],"sha":"b91799b1cb0e63785a6d7125e7bff42a0bccda56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/b91799b1cb0e63785a6d7125e7bff42a0bccda56"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/7daf379ed65e5591fc02406659f7b84f9d04a0d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:18:35Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:18:35Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"freefall §5: causal-loop checks via normal input + cadence evidence\n\ntest_freefall_causal drives the detection->wave->rearm loop through\nthe real input surface only (FreefallInput flags + real\nfrontendTimingUpdate outputs — no rt field pokes after intro):\n\n- Lock gate: every radarLocks increment coincides with a live\n  type-3 marker within dist<=15 that same step (0 violations,\n  3 seeds x 900 frames); wavesArmed tracks locks 1:1.\n- With no marker in proximity, missileBudget/missileTimer/\n  wavesArmed never move — downstream is gated on the <=15 check.\n- Full chain: lock -> budget += wave+(rand&1) -> spawn one\n  frameStep later -> budget drains to 0 -> marker sinks ->\n  radarTimer rearms -> new marker -> second lock inside 30s.\n- Input cannot prevent locks: the FUN_004119ec wander pool always\n  contains the player''s own position, so every measured weave\n  still locks — evasion delays but cannot zero the gate.\n\nCadence: real frontendTimingUpdate at 30/60/120 Hz yields\nframeStep=1 with smoothed centering ~1.006/~0.53/~0.29 (integer-ms\nrawDelta quantization). Player trajectory is cadence-invariant\n(accel scales with frameUnits, positions integrate dtSec) while\nframe-domain timers tick per rendered frame — radarReArms scale\nwith render rate (6 -> 12 -> 21 in 30 real s); the causal loop\ncompletes at every cadence. Alloc/init chain evidence already\ncovered by test_freefall_freelist (LIFO + stale-field reuse).\n\nNative suite: 583271 checks, 0 failures.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6371e32390fa6e411c63f5ddce700d01910b5fa5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/6371e32390fa6e411c63f5ddce700d01910b5fa5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/7daf379ed65e5591fc02406659f7b84f9d04a0d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/7daf379ed65e5591fc02406659f7b84f9d04a0d8","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDdkYWYzNzllZDY1ZTU1OTFmYzAyNDA2NjU5ZjdiODRmOWQwNGEwZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/2174730948120f5ca21f9c5b89d0594259e3d498","sha":"2174730948120f5ca21f9c5b89d0594259e3d498","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/2174730948120f5ca21f9c5b89d0594259e3d498"}],"sha":"7daf379ed65e5591fc02406659f7b84f9d04a0d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/7daf379ed65e5591fc02406659f7b84f9d04a0d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/2174730948120f5ca21f9c5b89d0594259e3d498/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:09:48Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:09:48Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"freefall §4C: serial veil ordering via per-pixel chain mask\n\nscreen_texture snapshots the opaque pass only, so overlapping veil\nshaders each produced lut[r2][p] instead of lut[r2][lut[r1][p]] —\nLUT-level measurement showed ~86% of (r1,r2,p) triples differ.\n\nfreefallSceneVeilMask rasterizes the frame''s ordered veil ops\n(trail sections, kind-5 flares, radar wedge tris) through the\nfolded mode-2 projection into 8 ordered {row,z''} records per px,\npacked RGBAH and uploaded as mask_tex. The three veil shaders\nreplay the chain in painter order, gated per-element against the\nlinearized opaque depth — a buried element writes the winner''s\ncolor back (identity) rather than remapping it.\n\nDraw-order correction, OBSERVED and documented: the radar wedge''s\nkey is pz=0 — the SMALLEST obj.z — making it the FARTHEST draw in\nthe ascending-key walk, not painter-last as earlier docs claimed.\nWedge records therefore sort first at every shared px. Its wedge\ntris also overlap each other in projection (rings inside rings),\nso serial composition applies on nearly every cone px.\n\nDiagnostics exported via ff_veil_mask: ops, elems, covered, multi,\noverflow. Live campaign: multi ~= covered on cone px; overflow 0\nfor ~95% of ticks, spikes to ~700 during dense trail clusters.\n\nNative suite: 580540 checks, 0 failures.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9dacd3abc7255470b780662d6fd0634f8d5f0b66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/9dacd3abc7255470b780662d6fd0634f8d5f0b66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/2174730948120f5ca21f9c5b89d0594259e3d498","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/2174730948120f5ca21f9c5b89d0594259e3d498","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDIxNzQ3MzA5NDgxMjBmNWNhMjFmOWM1Yjg5ZDA1OTQyNTllM2Q0OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/d8d8fd56ddd8a9c3dd421bf5905f2961206e62c4","sha":"d8d8fd56ddd8a9c3dd421bf5905f2961206e62c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/d8d8fd56ddd8a9c3dd421bf5905f2961206e62c4"}],"sha":"2174730948120f5ca21f9c5b89d0594259e3d498","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/2174730948120f5ca21f9c5b89d0594259e3d498"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/d8d8fd56ddd8a9c3dd421bf5905f2961206e62c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:31:04Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:31:04Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"§4A/§4B: depth-flag probe + rgb565 audit; fix stale palette caches\n\n- §4A: minimal overlap probe on the shipped Godot/Metal build —\n  depth_draw_never keeps the test (write-off only), matching docs;\n  e5a4487''s render_mode edit was functionally neutral for\n  ALPHA-writing shaders. Recorded in FREEFALL_BACKDROP.md §8;\n  probe scene preserved under analysis-private/depth_probe.\n- §4B: audited all five FALLP palettes x 64 bank-0 LUT rows —\n  every rgb565 collision is an identical-RGB duplicate (3 per\n  palette), zero LUT-divergent losers: exact recovery for\n  palette-exact pixels. Shaders'' \"lossless\" claim rescoped.\n- Real bug: ff_palette and every palette-derived cache loaded\n  once and never invalidated — course>=1 freefall in a campaign\n  would run veil lookups through FALLP1''s map (~119 colors -> 0).\n  _apply_freefall now drops idx/pal/lut textures, all material\n  caches, and the PICK sprite on palette change.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integrat