ame FONTSML/FONTBIG\n  renderers the stream presenter uses, SYS_PAL head as text palette\n- transparent 600x360 indexed strip -> RGBA overlay on a CanvasLayer\n  above the 3D descent; hidden with the mode-2 handoff\n- resolve-miss (0x41cb25) stays a silent no-op\n- native test asserts the course gate and exact name/flags/rate;\n  live capture verified slide-in/full-size hold/page-out timing\n\nBriefing follow-on (verified on the natural route): the split block\nkeeps the draw string terminated in buf0 (cursor + NUL) — buf1 is\nthe lookahead measure copy; \\x with no number resets x=0; flag==0\ntails draw non-centered. Regression test: mid-typing \\c line shows\nno stale tail.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e259596aa4429f68aeb08e7f6a3490a94d954c8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/e259596aa4429f68aeb08e7f6a3490a94d954c8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/fcf1b90cb4ff902b8070e95a3e96f7ae86040672","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"