com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"mode-6 briefing: L%d_MAP Earth backdrop + BRIEF%d typewriter machine\n\nImplements FUN_00429cb4 sub-3 + FUN_004296f0 pump + FUN_0042acd4 walk +\nFUN_00429600 exit from MDK95.EXE disasm (observed addresses in header):\n\n- L%d_MAP blit (rec+0x304 -> 600x360 indexed), BRIEF%d via MDKFONT.FTI,\n  FONTBIG centered draw at x=300, penY=32 +36/line\n- Fade pump: bee4/beec=2.0*dt (x2 hurry latch), bee8/bef0 out, with\n  FUN_00416410 palette blend (src*trunc(t*256)+arg*(256-..))>>8\n- Typewriter: c24c budget at 15/60 cps, c254 blink &0x1f cursor,\n  c25c esc latch -> 2000 instant page, bf04=5.0 key-hold\n- Escape machine: \\c \\n \\x \\y \\p \\d \\i with optional signed numbers;\n  two-buffer lookahead for centered measure\n- OBSERVED quirk: palette tail copy is byte-exact from record FILE\n  offset +0xc0 — the 4-byte record header shifts palette bytes\n  [0xbc..0x2fc) into entries 64..255 (1 1/3-entry misalignment,\n  top 4 bytes never load); reproduced verbatim\n- Bridge: mode6_active/frame/diag + briefingEnter_ binding STATS.BNI/\n  MDKFONT.FTI; Godot: BriefingLayer/BriefingRect, _apply_mode6 pump\n- New-game route verified live: menu -> briefing (Earth + typed\n  newsflash) -> freefall -> traversal handoff\n- Tests: synthetic-asset unit tests for fades, pace, bf04 hold,\n  hurry, esc skip, \\d/\\i budget, \\x arg, quirk palette, missing map\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b24e3041b63c8f396060b8a82fbeb318d3d80a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/4b24e3041b63c8f396060b8a82fbeb318d3d80a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/21e3574d418ada375c449d7726d4ffd7a72d98f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","eve