h9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/02f4bd2651d5d623aa3c3f5008735d2b193be2de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:21:38Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:21:38Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"ff-trace: fix type-3 radar blind spot + synchronized diagnostics\n\nThe object loop continued on type != 1 before the type-3 beam block —\nthe radar path was unreachable (aggregate counters still printed, but\nno beam-to-player spatial evidence). Restructured dispatch by type:\nchute (4), radar (3), missile (1) each handled.\n\nEvery radar line now carries sim seconds, wall seconds, sim tick and\nrender frame; the header pins build (MDK_BUILD env), course, skill\nand RNG seed. Per-object lines emit the lock-test inputs directly —\nbeam tx/ty/tz, scan-plane z, wander target, player xyz, d^2 vs the\n225 threshold, phase (rise/scan/sink) and whether the wedge twin was\nsubmitted this frame. Edge prints (LOCK/REARM/HIT) gained wall+tick;\nthe periodic line records polled gameplay keys.\n\nVerified: d2 966 -> 220 crossing the threshold produces ph=sink +\nLOCK #1 + budget=3 on the same tick.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7116d2487afb703d8a30d108450e61ee2afce0d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/7116d2487afb703d8a30d108450e61ee2afce0d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Trans