tent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/e8cc920141c0c63bba70ae4c6aaaf9233a3fc2f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T03:35:52Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T03:35:52Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"LUT veil pass: screen-space dst=lut[row][dst] for trail/flare/wedge\n\nAll three mode-2 veil effects now composite the indexed operation\nonto the already-drawn screen at real depth, replacing both\napproximations the 1125 review named:\n\n- Trail: un-baked from backdropFrame (the always-behind-all-bodies\n  seam); world-space section quads ride a per-vertex LUT row through\n  an ImmediateMesh, depth-tested against the 3D bodies.\n- FLARE4: the key-color RGBA billboard is gone; the veil shader\n  evaluates dst = lut[6+count+srcPx][dst] per texel, px0 discards.\n- Radar wedge: alpha-blend approximation replaced by the same exact\n  remap through the painter-last variant (no depth test, priority\n  1 — the original sorts it last by its z''~=0 object key).\n\nThe shaders recover the destination index through a 256x256\nrgb565->index lookup — every presented pixel is a palette-exact\ncolor (unshaded materials, nearest filtering, palette-expanded\nbackdrop/textures), so the remap reproduces the indexed op exactly.\nResidual seam (documented): screen_texture snapshots only the\nopaque pass, so veil pixels under an earlier veil apply one remap\nrather than the serial chain — bounded vs the original''s painter\ncompositing, and only where veils overlap.\n\nNative freefallSceneTrailComposite stays the headless/test\ncompositor. Smoke asserts the lookup textures, a live wedge mesh on\nthe veil shader, and a trail mesh during a wave. 111 fps vs the\n~103-120 fps pre-change range.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4ea62c02012e0025d89b756239ef9cd113e7bd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/b4ea62c02012e0025d89b756239ef9cd113e7bd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/e8cc920141c0c63bba70ae4c6aaaf9233a3fc2f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/e8cc920141c0c63bba70ae4c6aaaf9233a3fc2f3","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGU4Y2M5MjAxNDFjMGM2M2JiYTcwYWU0YzZhYWFmOTIzM2EzZmMyZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/ccc35b930b9fb1246d89f0d26dc2513951aea362","sha":"ccc35b930b9fb1246d89f0d26dc2513951aea362","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/ccc35b930b9fb1246d89f0d26dc2513951aea362"}],"sha":"e8cc920141c0c63bba70ae4c6aaaf9233a3fc2f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/e8cc920141c0c63bba70ae4c6aaaf9233a3fc2f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/ccc35b930b9fb1246d89f0d26dc2513951aea362/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T03:26:43Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T03:26:43Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Radar wedge: procedural RADAR model, PICK scale 32.0, causal counters\n\nPICK marker: 0x494d30 qword is the double 32.0 (bytes\n00..00 40 40), not 3.0 — scale = trunc(8000/z''), ~10.7x\nlarger; -1e-5 sort bias neighbor corroborates.\n\nRadar wedge (FUN_00411f48 + FUN_00411aac tail): the beam is a\ncode-built model, not a kind-1 sprite — 25 verts (apex + 4\nhex rings, 0.866 trig), 46 tris at LUT pens -1029..-1033.\nradarTick restructured to the original if/else shape with the\nuniversal presentation tail: pos = -4*camera, verts regen on\nall live paths. freefallObjectModelSlot maps radar to slot 2\nand protoForSlot synthesizes the model. Spawn verified NOT to\nreset +0x11c — the LIFO stale-timer spawn-death churn is\noriginal behavior (FUN_00412060/FUN_0040f9d0 disasm).\n\nGodot: negative tri materials < -1028 route to a LUT-veil\nmaterial (key color, alpha 90/256, unshaded, depth_draw off)\nmatching the original''s painter-last z''=0 veil. ff-dump-dir\nnow resolves relative paths and mkdir -p''s. ff-trace gains\nradar beam/lock/rearm/armed/spawn diagnostics; snapshot\nemits radar counters + beam_mdk/aux_mdk object fields.\n\nVerified live: wedge renders as a translucent funnel from\nthe camera-mirror apex to the beam point; locks -> missile\nwaves -> re-arm cycles repeat through the descent.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c55f00522c5bcef05a9b98458b17c7ebcf63fd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/6c55f00522c5bcef05a9b98458b17c7ebcf63fd7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/ccc35b930b9fb1246d89f0d26dc2513951aea362","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"htt