repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/865720e89248da7571d238817cad3b305e9641d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T02:02:43Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T02:02:43Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Exact freefall visual contracts: indexed trail composite, PICK scale, ZOOM status\n\n- Trail veil: bake dst=lut[row][dst] into backdropFrame in index\n  space (freefallSceneTrailComposite), replacing the frontend 3D\n  ImmediateMesh + keycolor-alpha approximation. Oldest->newest\n  walk, pens -1054/-1058..-1065 -> rows 25/29-36, taper table.\n- Kind-1 PICK: recover OBSERVED scale trunc(750/z'') (0x494d30 is\n  the rodata double 3.0 read via fmul qword, not a runtime patch);\n  8.8 fixed blit outPx = srcPx*scale>>8, gate z''>0.\n- ZOOM: per-table validity (zoomOk[16]), require all 16 before\n  emitting, FreefallBackdropStatus + bridge ready/mask emits,\n  frontend warning + quad hidden when not ready.\n- ParseZoomRows extracted; independent format test with explicit\n  fixture bytes, malformed/truncated/old-+8-offset coverage;\n  trail-composite test compares a hand-built model against the\n  whole 600x360 frame; backdrop-status test.\n- Layer census: pod-bay/pickup tan quads are authored FFObj\n  billboards (not a stale plane); remove the old 3D trail path;\n  keep layer instrumentation out of normal play.\n- Add --ff-dump-dir/--ff-dump-every consecutive-frame capture of\n  game output only (viewport texture).\n- Doc: correct stale trail pen/oldest-section notes, kind-1 scale\n  OBSERVED, boundary seams.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7593d5f9e78b2b9eb5630f3ef88d73a13961af9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/c7593d5f9e78b2b9eb5630f3ef88d73a13961af9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/865720e89248da7571d238817cad3b305e9641d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/865720e89248da7571d238817cad3b305e9641d1","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDg2NTcyMGU4OTI0OGRhNzU3MWQyMzg4MTdjYWQzYjMwNWU5NjQxZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/3d5ca32dcd9d8a2404f5733852bc549dbd4cd2b3","sha":"3d5ca32dcd9d8a2404f5733852bc549dbd4cd2b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/3d5ca32dcd9d8a2404f5733852bc549dbd4cd2b3"}],"sha":"865720e89248da7571d238817cad3b305e9641d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/865720e89248da7571d238817cad3b305e9641d1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/3d5ca32dcd9d8a2404f5733852bc549dbd4cd2b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:14:27Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:14:37Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Fix ZOOM span-table header: 4-byte size-4 prefix, not 8\n\nThe loader skipped payloadFileOffset + 8, treating the u32 after\nsize-4 as a padding field. On real FALL3D.BNI data that word is\nrow 0''s cntA (150 — the all-shaded top row), so the +8 walk read\nthe first shade byte run as cntA = 0x03030303, tripped the bounds\ncheck, and discarded all 16 tables: zoomCount = 0, backdropFrame\nstayed zeroed, and the packaged backdrop quad rendered black.\n\nVerified against the real records: all 16 ZOOM tables are exactly\n180 rows, every row sums cntA+cntB+cntC == 150 quads (600 px), and\nthe walk consumes each record to the last byte. Synthetic fixture\nand FREEFALL_BACKDROP.md updated; frame now fills 216000/216