de row base 0x4edbf4=0xc00 (row 12+shade).\n- Trail: element-0 min/max-X anchors, +0x20 read cursor (ring walk\n  oldest->newest), pen = -1054 body / count-s-1066 (-1058..-1065)\n  newest eight -> LUT rows 25/29-36; taper table 0x49b634.\n- Kind-5 FLARE: +0x11c=60 ramp / +0x108 decay gate already in the\n  runtime; bridge emits flare/subTimer, marker, basis_mdk, nose_local,\n  trail edges+taper+pens; FLARE4/PICK indexed sprites exposed.\n- Kind-1 PICK marker on pickup records (+0x10c gate).\n- Godot: camera-locked 600x360 backdrop quad replaces the flat\n  ground plane; trail colors derive from the pen->LUT veil table;\n  FLARE4 pre-baked per-count textures; PICK marker disc (scale\n  HYPOTHESIS — 0x494d30 is runtime-patched).\n- Synthetic test: LEVEL/POD/ZOOM/chunk/FLARE/PICK loaders, LUT row\n  colors, seam wedge bytes, 16.16 texel walk (raw + shaded phases),\n  line doubling, chunk scale/pen-0, ring cursor wrap, pen map.\n\nEvidence: docs/reverse-engineering/FREEFALL_BACKDROP.md.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7870e19b9b2c39769232673b2cd7f19f820043c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/d7870e19b9b2c39769232673b2cd7f19f820043c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/db558bdee72bd1d1243cc572ae79e8b6aae6888d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0"