s, trail ring\n\nThree evidenced presentation repairs, no gameplay changes:\n\n- Minecrawler: LEVEL%d''s 1024px indexed surface loads per course\n  (FUN_00412530''s source image and presents as the z=0 ground\n  plane; POD-strip/LUT scrolling stays a documented approximation.\n- Missile pose: FUN_0041139c''s velocity-tracking basis at +0xac —\n  {norm(vel x prevCol2), norm(vel), col0 x vel} — runs every tick\n  after the z-throttle, replacing the stale euler transform so the\n  body turns with flight direction.\n- Trail: the +0x60 ring record (FUN_0042eaa8/eadc/eb3c/ecc4/ee74)\n  carries model-space extreme-x anchors transformed by the basis\n  into a 32-slot ring; the bridge emits tapered edge pairs and the\n  presenter draws them as a world-space ribbon.\n\nQA-only additions: ff-msl trace line, --ff-shot-pass trigger.\nNative tests 145949/0; live course-0/course-1 captures confirm all\nthree (align=1.00 basis tracking, trl ring fill, visible streak).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nEOF\n)","tree":{"sha":"5e2ce030cbede3f55faa872de83907a41fe1d66f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/5e2ce030cbede3f55faa872de83907a41fe1d66f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/2795a42faf0baa3176496e1d581139273c2c9d5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"h