ath\ncarries scripted steering (no dict shortcut). Final-approach policy\noscillates perpendicular to the inbound missile bearing on a fixed\ncadence; serpentine sweeps when threats are live but far.\n\n--ff-trace logs hp transitions, nearest inbound missile lateral\nseparation, polled internal key codes, and the type-4 pickup\nchute lifecycle (deploy edge, glide vz toward the -50 cap).\n\nBoth flags are QA-gated; ordinary runs are unaffected.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6dbb16d3074a7d6722c7780af76a963c0693a45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/e6dbb16d3074a7d6722c7780af76a963c0693a45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/cc778602f57a5bbba422828503e5cd06eaa01366","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/cc778602f57a5bbba422828503e5cd06eaa01366","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGNjNzc4NjAyZjU3YTViYmJhNDIyODI4NTAzZTVjZDA2ZWFhMDEzNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/5af846eb3875a866c8002364427f0a279d7ebb03","sha":"5af846eb3875a866c8002364427f0a279d7ebb03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/5af846eb3875a866c8002364427f0a279d7ebb03"}],"sha":"cc778602f57a5bbba422828503e5cd06eaa01366","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/cc778602f57a5bbba422828503e5cd06eaa01366"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/5af846eb3875a866c8002364427f0a279d7ebb03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:46:26Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:46:26Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"19G — first-playable recovery after failed owner playtest\n\nSix owner-reported defects traced and repaired (checkpoint, not an\nacceptance declaration — human retest pending):\n\n- audio: SNI PCM8 unsigned bytes were memcpy''d into Godot\n  FORMAT_8_BITS (expects signed) — DC offset at half full scale;\n  stream_audio converts at the boundary, applied at all 4 SNI->WAV\n  sites (50/53 traversal SFX records are PCM8).\n- input: live _process never populated \"keys\", and\n  gameplayBindingsFromSettings was never called — gameplay\n  bindings stayed factory-default regardless of menu rebinds.\n  _gameplay_keys() polls physical keys into internal codes;\n  syncBindings_() mirrors the live flow tables each step.\n- objects: objectGeometryFromModel discarded per-tri material\n  index + UVs and Godot painted per-element debug hash colors —\n  enemies rendered as prismatic blobs. Shared emitMaterialSurfaces\n  now preserves (element,material) surface groups with UVs and\n  resolves material names through the arena banks (shared\n  LEVELnS.MTI first, embedded .MAT second), reusing the\n  FALL3D-family 0x24-byte tri record layout (idx@+0, s16 mat@+6,\n  uv[3][2]@+8 — corroborated).\n- chute: rt.vert.eventIdle and rt.eventPriority both map to the\n  same original field 0x540cbc but were split in the port — the\n  vertical layer''s \"==7 -> 0\" sustain reset never reached the\n  dispatcher''s priority latch, pinning locoState at 0x2be. Aliased\n  across the vertical step on both normal and sniper paths.\n- scope: SubViewport camera never set current and the aperture\n  used ViewportTexture.new() (does not resolve at runtime) ->\n  unrendered checkerboard. Now camera.current post-add_child +\n  viewport.get_texture(); same fix on bullet-cam viewports.\n- export: Finder re-stamps com.apple.FinderInfo on Desktop-visible\n  bundles between export and sign -> codesign \"detritus\" failure;\n  scrub + sign now retries.\n\nQA: --combat-demo / --chute-demo / --step imply runtime stepping\nunder --screenshot (plain --screenshot still freezes the frame-0\nspawn pose); --set-key-global debug seam for binding tests.\n\nTests: mdk_frontend_tests 340/0, mdk_tests 145949/0 (incl. new\njump-sustain -> loco 0x2bd regression), Godot smoke 0 failures.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"02d8631a5de91662cd3a56493370ac9cba6f2079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/02d8631a5de91662cd3a56493370ac9cba6f2079"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/5af846eb3875a866c8002364427f0a279d7ebb03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/5af846eb3875a866c8002364427f0a279d7ebb03","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDVhZjg0NmViMzg3NWE4NjZjODAwMjM2NDQyN2YwYTI3OWQ3ZWJiMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/030fa500eee075928b4dfd9026efe7c81d991f19","sha":"030fa500eee075928b4dfd9026efe7c81d991f19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/030fa500eee075928b4dfd9026efe7c81d991f19"}],"sha":"5af846eb3875a866c8002364427f0a279d7ebb03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/5af846eb3875a866c8002364427f0a279d7ebb03"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/030fa500eee075928b4dfd9026efe7c81d991f19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T00:07:01Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T00:07:01Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19F — traversal zone ambience + frontend music playback evidence\n\nZone ambience (FUN_00431e50/431cf4/431fbc): each arena''s CMI table-3\nstructure head {lenstr A, lenstr B, u32} names the ambient pair —\nOBSERVED across LEVEL3..LEVEL8 (strB -> flags=3 looped records in\nLEVEL<n>O.SNI, CORRIDOR in LEVEL<n>S.SNI). traversalZoneAudioTick\nre-resolves the pair per frame, rotates the old pair to outgoing\nslots on change, and drives the corroborated fade math: in +0x80\n-> 0x7fff via record-scoped kSetVolume (FUN_00402658/02698), out\n-0x100 -> name-scoped kStop (FUN_0040210c). Unresolvable names\n(AMB_DRIP/H9WATER in LEVEL3) stay silent slots. LEVEL<n>O.SNI loads\nbeside the S bank; stereo SNI records decode verbatim (SIREN/SWIND).\n\nFrontend music: write the Sound screen''s mutated DAT_00541308/0c\nglobals back every frame so the same-frame VolumesApplied push sees\nlive values (was exit-path only). Playback-level smoke evidence:\nMAINSONG/OPTSONG stream resolution, live player, advancing position,\nslider volume push, stop/restart around the Sound screen.\n\nQA: --pace-trace mode-5 wall-clock limiter trace; smoke bank count\n4 (O bank); reload-clear bounds allow the re-armed zone pair.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0949b600321057cdfc9ad55173969bd75d44495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/d0949b600321057cdfc9ad55173969bd75d44495"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/030fa500eee075928b4dfd9026efe7c81d991f19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type"