bs\n  ship in Contents/Frameworks, signed inside-out, @rpath only —\n  no build-machine paths in LC_RPATH, notices+LGPL text bundled.\n\nVerified: 3126/3126 natural EOF -> mode 0; abort -> mode 0;\nrepeat re-arms FLIC+FINISH sounds; pytest 33/33; native 145914.","tree":{"sha":"08d9f398a2c1fd9ef6a98779b6142dbf19b7a95a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/08d9f398a2c1fd9ef6a98779b6142dbf19b7a95a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/9b9fe272cbd8683d5076a9b41c732faf3f7bb6f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/9b9fe272cbd8683d5076a9b41c732faf3f7bb6f4","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDliOWZlMjcyY2JkODY4M2Q1MDc2YTliNDFjNzMyZmFmM2Y3YmI2ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/c5873ad7e3ddf70ab9b00b75a7a4bf5308184c4e","sha":"c5873ad7e3ddf70ab9b00b75a7a4bf5308184c4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/c5873ad7e3ddf70ab9b00b75a7a4bf5308184c4e"}],"sha":"9b9fe272cbd8683d5076a9b41c732faf3f7bb6f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/9b9fe272cbd8683d5076a9b41c732faf3f7bb6f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/c5873ad7e3ddf70ab9b00b75a7a4bf5308184c4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:15:34Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T16:15:34Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19D — mode-8 ending: FLIC decoder + cinematic pump\n\nFlicDecoder (src/core/flic_decoder.*): AF11/AF12 stream layout,\nF100 prefix skip, COLOR256/DELTA_FLC/BRUN/LCOPY chunks — verified\nagainst the corpus (MDK12 82/82, MDKEND 316/316, exact spans, sane\noutput). BRUN sign + COLOR256 count semantics are EMPIRICAL per the\nevidence policy; the 0xb count==0 no-write quirk preserved.\n\nEndingCinematic (src/core/ending_cinematic.*): FUN_0047b3f4''s mark\nscript — FINISH.BNI sound marks, 0xd2 restore, the 0xe9 30-tick\nhold (49b6e8 = 1/tick OBSERVED), stage boundary at stream end.\nRamp shape is HYPOTHESIS (47b384 uncaptured).\n\nBridge: mode-8 dispatch + endingRequested edge (script op 0x51 ->\nprogressionEnterCinematic), endingEnter_/ending_frame/ending_\ndrain_audio/ending_diag/load_ending; the MVE boundary takes the\noriginal''s missing-file edge to the returning frontend (the .MVE\nplayer is a later phase). main.gd: EndingLayer, paced pump,\nFINISH.BNI players, --ending QA flag.\n\nVerified: --ending --frames 2400 headless -> 316/316 -> boundary\n-> mode 0; GUI run pumps paced frames + resolves all 5 sounds.\nTests: test_flic_decoder/test_ending_cinematic synthetic suites;\nmdk_tests 145914/0, frontend 329/0, pytest 33/33, ctest 1/1.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f274f3c7164bd2b988d5f8acd718c5099033a80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/0f274f3c7164bd2b988d5f8acd718c5099033a80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/c5873ad7e3ddf70ab9b00b75a7a4bf5308184c4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/u