":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:57:34Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"19C.3/19C.4 — freefall audio + frontend music host\n\nMode-2: FALL3D.SNI+MDKSOUND.SNI bank set in the bridge, per-step\nkFfEvSound -> shared-mixer translation (OBSERVED 0x4edc3c..98 tag\ntable; b = play-mode on singles, group index on the K_HIT/K_COLL\nrand runs), stopAll at the FUN_0040fa68 teardown edge, mode-2 owns\nvoices in the GDScript sweep.\n\nFrontend: OPTIONS.BNI MAINSONG (FUN_0041d720 ambient bed) +\nMDKSOUND.SNI music-class OPTSONG/OPTBUTT decode on a\nfrontend-lifetime bank set; MenuSongStart/Pause/Resume fx and the\nSoundAudioEvent queue now drive real AudioStreamPlayers; the\nDAT_00541308/0c volumes resync per frame.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b2ff00276ede35a964174bf3b289a3f8c5c00306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/b2ff00276ede35a964174bf3b289a3f8c5c00306"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/f7c1689b52b86a6ff39bdee3b3a160b6f3109a30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/f7c1689b52b86a6ff39bdee3b3a160b6f3109a30","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGY3YzE2ODliNTJiODZhNmZmMzliZGVlM2IzYTE2MGI2ZjMxMDlhMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/080e7ce37d20cfec47065e81e4db90755a527441","sha":"080e7ce37d20cfec47065e81e4db90755a527441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/080e7ce37d20cfec47065e81e4db90755a527441"}],"sha":"f7c1689b52b86a6ff39bdee3b3a160b6f3109a30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/f7c1689b52b86a6ff39bdee3b3a160b6f3109a30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/080e7ce37d20cfec47065e81e4db90755a527441/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:22:56Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T15:22:56Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19C.1 (Godot): Mode-5 host pacing + fe_active audio drain\n\nHost-side wall-clock pacing for the live StreamScene: one sim step\nper ~33.3ms of accumulated monotonic time via _stream_pace_run(),\nbounded catch-up at 4 (the limiter''s own t1>4 bound) with backlog\ndropped on a stall. The bridge stays one-call/one-step and all\ndeterministic harnesses keep driving step_frame_input directly, so\ngoldens are untouched. Verified interactively: 600 display frames\n@~106fps -> 153 sim steps (unpaced would be 600/finished); a\n--skill 1 paced run reaches the natural 466-step exit and hands off\nto mode 6.\n\nTwo drain gaps found + fixed in passing: under fe_active the mode-5\nbranch never reached _drain_audio_fx (voice commands queued but no\nplayers spawned), and the standalone post-exit path skipped the\nteardown tail drain (the WIND loop''s player would keep sounding\ninto the next mode). Both branches now drain on the rendered-frame\ncadence.\n\nRegression: pytest 33/33, mdk_frontend_tests 329/0, mdk_tests\n145872/0, CTest green both trees, traversal x6 + freefall x5 +\nmode-5 x5 goldens all exact.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"792337197f3976387bf23f19701fcf76ba671473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/792337197f3976387bf23f19701fcf76ba671473"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/080e7ce37d20cfec47065e81e4db90755a527441","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/080e7ce37d20cfec47065e81e4db90755a527441","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDA4MGU3Y2UzN2QyMGNmZWM0NzA2NWU4MWU0ZGI5MDc1NWE1Mjc0NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/825c12172cfcaea0fe326179dae1a233096c5082","sha":"825c12172cfcaea0fe326179dae1a233096c5082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/825c12172cfcaea0fe326179dae1a233096c5082"}],"sha":"080e7ce37d20cfec47065e81e4db90755a527441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/080e7ce37d20cfec47065e81e4db90755a527441"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/825c12172cfcaea0fe326179dae1a233096c5082/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:58:17Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:58:17Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19C.0 (Godot): macOS export pipeline\n\nReproducible .app export for the Godot frontend: 4.7.2.stable export\ntemplates, export_presets.cfg (universal output — the only arch the\nofficial template ships), and export_macos.sh which thins the\nuniversal binary to arm64 (the GDExtension is arm64-only), re-signs\nad-hoc inside-out with library-validation disabled, and verifies\n--deep --strict.\n\nproject.godot: config/name -> \"MDK\" (the .app/bundle/user:// root\nname); enable ETC2/ASTC import flag the arm64 export gate requires\n(no imported textures exist — the flag is export-config only).","tree":{"sha":"89018c8dc4cfdc77406d122d973c870c6c159fc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/89018c8dc4cfdc77406d122d973c870c6c159fc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/825c12172cfcaea0fe326179dae1a233096c5082","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/825c12172cfcaea0fe326179dae1a233096c5082","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDgyNWMxMjE3MmNmY2FlYTBmZTMyNjE3OWRhZTFhMjMzMDk2YzUwODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/c3c768e2e89c5b10a11eb6dbaa9013ba9d46b8b2","sha":"c3c768e2e89c5b10a11eb6dbaa9013ba9d46b8b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/c3c768e2e89c5b10a11eb6dbaa9013ba9d46b8b2"}],"sha":"825c12172cfcaea0fe326179dae1a233096c5082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/825c12172cfcaea0fe326179dae1a233096c5082"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/c3c768e2e89c5b10a11eb6dbaa9013ba9d46b8b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:19:43Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T14:19:43Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19B.3B1 (Godot): add Mode-5 audio playback\n\nThe remaining Mode-5 host seam — audio — closes through the shared\nprocess-global TraversalAudioMixer via a new Godot-free\nStreamAudioHost. No second audio engine, no core sim change.\n\n- stream_audio.{h,cpp}: OBSERVED 039c8/02e2c registration table\n  (eleven STREAM.BNI records, vol 0x7fff, DS-loop on WIND alone),\n  StreamEvent->mixer translation (tag plays: aux==0 ensure /\n  aux!=0 restart; tag=-1 02160 name-bound positional marker;\n  tag-bound name-scoped stop), camView_ listener feed, per-lifetime\n  census.\n- Mixer stopAll(): the bank-free teardown arm (FUN_0042c824 /\n  FUN_004371bc release every live instance).\n- Bridge: BNI-first resolve + memoized SniWave->AudioStreamWAV\n  decode (native rate, mono, loop points for WIND), listener gated\n  on the counted 4026f8 seam (the exit step feeds nothing),\n  per-step consume+tick, teardown tail drain + stopAll, snd_*\n  census keys in stream_diag.\n- main.gd: mode-5 per-frame drain on the traversal cadence, audio\n  census + WIND-singleton/leak gates in stream+campaign smokes,\n  repeat-entry WIND lifecycle checks.\n- stream_census: same host+mixer wiring on real BUILD_A data.\n- 52 new frontend checks; pytest census pins for c0/c4.\n\nCensus (all courses natural exit): WIND plays=1 stops=1, listener\n== core seam (465/451/412/412/353), active=0 post-teardown,\nunknown/resolve/decode misses and pool exhaustion all 0. All five\nnative goldens, six traversal and five freefall canonicals\nunchanged. TELETYPE is a mode-6 STATS.BNI record — bound-but-\nunreached in mode 5, nothing manufactured.\n\nMODE-5 GODOT AUDIO PLAYBACK: CLOSED FOR BUILD_A","tree":{"sha":"02ca47d6ab3d537641c0d23528e53cdb177c901c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/02ca47d6ab3d537641c0d23528e53cdb177c901c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/c3c768e2e89c5b10a11eb6dbaa9013ba9d46b8b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/c3c768e2e89c5b10a11eb6dbaa9013ba9d46b8b2","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGMzYzc2OGUyZTg5YzViMTBhMTFlYjZkYmFhOTAxM2JhOWQ0NmI4YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/6c7f11406821b5eb9f3220357157c3a24baf9030","sha":"6c7f11406821b5eb9f3220357157c3a24baf9030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/6c7f11406821b5eb9f3220357157c3a24baf9030"}],"sha":"c3c768e2e89c5b10a11eb6dbaa9013ba9d46b8b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/c3c768e2e89c5b10a11eb6dbaa9013ba9d46b8b2"},{"auth