m_diag (route edges, enter/exit counts,\nterminal state, the mode-5 bank bind), and diagnostic_end_level —\na test/QA mailbox write identical to the END_LEVEL script op.\n\nBONES.WHITE stale-bank oracle RESOLVED (outcome A): the real\ncampaign transition proves no traversal .MAT survives the\nFUN_004371bc -> FUN_0042b270 edge (rt_ null at entry,\nbank_b_bound=false); WHITE resolves NULL -> flat 0xff, matching\nthe native teardown ordering (FUN_004371bc calls FUN_0041a548).\n\n--campaign N smoke drives the real route per course: traversal ->\nEND_LEVEL -> mode 5 -> natural exit -> mode 6 -> freefall\n(levelId advance), mode-7 -> LEVEL5 for course 4 (carried health\nkeeps the hero latch — the death->0 arm stays covered by the\nstandalone --stream 4 convention), layer checks at every edge,\nplus in-session repeat entry/exit (mode5_enters=2, teardowns=2,\nno stale bank on re-entry).\n\nRegression: frontend_tests 266/0, mdk_tests 145872/0, CTest 1/1,\npytest 33/0/0, all five mode-5 goldens + six traversal + five\nfreefall digests EXACT.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"974c74202018e87c9f89c380813c5c766ecf3874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/974c74202018e87c9f89c380813c5c766ecf3874"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/6c7f11406821b5eb9f3220357157c3a24baf9030","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,