FFEE) to natural exit, establish the\ndeterministic golden oracle from the existing diagnostic surface,\nand audit every remaining seam.\n\nAll five courses exit naturally (hero-rescue latch c0-3, hero-death\nwrite c4), replay byte-identical, and no category-A core seam\nexecutes: poolErr/quit/drawListOverflow/teletypeOverflow all 0. The\ngolden values, cross-course sanity audit (incl. the c2/c3\ncounter-surface coincidence, traced to the hashed-but-non-binding\ndriftMax/radiusMax caps), and closure-audit answers are documented\nin STREAM_SCENE.md §18.\n\nDiagnostic additions only, no semantic changes: expose the\nFUN_00408eb0 pool-error count and DAT_0054148e quit latch, and print\na full seam-census summary line so the golden audit reports every\ndispatch/host-boundary counter directly.\n\nRegression: mdk_tests 145872/0, CTest 1/1, traversal L3-8 and\nfreefall c0-c4 canonical digests unchanged.\n\nMODE-5 CINEMATIC CORE: CLOSED FOR BUILD_A.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f444262910e113c8d164702b35171ad8b7160a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/f444262910e113c8d164702b35171ad8b7160a9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/1117fcf56680065408079d81fbfc291158774970","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c