/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/8ee571e40e84d60393c32cbb9f452298edc29e08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:55:14Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T22:55:14Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19A.2H0 (Cinematic-Core): reconcile Mode-5 closure seams\n\nFinal core-boundary audit of the section-16 seam list. fillSelect\n(FUN_0046ae60) is implemented: the four-comparator install into\n0x49bbe8 writes projectorSel_ and project6b4f8''s fill arm dispatches\non the image-verified per-variant constants (46ad20/ad58/ad9c/ade0/\nae1c; both mode-5 sites pass 0). The remaining listed seams are\nverified host/presentation boundaries for Phase 19B: the e684\nframebuffer blit, the 13b40/46d208 palette DAC upload, the 46c86c\nDirectDraw present, the 0c860 raster dispatch, and the 5414ac\npace-wait / 46c650 clock inside the (already implemented) 2fb68\nlimiter. Stale seam labels corrected; STREAM_SCENE.md gains the\nsection-17 audit table. mdk_tests 145872/0, CTest 1/1, traversal\nL3-L8 and freefall c0-c4 canonical digests unchanged.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"36f98c8d74e576ce38de0b32b3bb081d495889fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/36f98c8d74e576ce38de0b32b3bb081d495889fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/8ee571e40e84d60393c32cbb9f452298edc29e08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c