"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/44a241f4c0a772f2a276e29f195220ea56793cec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:52:32Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:52:32Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19A.2G (Cinematic-Core): implement Mode-5 trail ribbon engine\n\nReplace the count-only ribbonDraw seam with the decoded ribbon band:\nemitDrawList (FUN_0042e100) now runs the masked-window bucket walk\n(cur=(winHi-1)&0x1f, stop=winLo&0x1f — masked compare BEFORE the\ndecrement, so buckets winHi-2..winLo draw, the winHi-1 bucket''s ring\nfeeds the first band but its objects never draw, and span ≡ 1 mod 32\nno-ops) with the projected-ring double buffer swapping at each\nbucket tail so every ring projects exactly once.\n\nPer bucket: 16x project6b4f8 ring projection then exactly 32 e620\ncalls — the i=0..14 loop plus the unrolled i=15 wrap tail:\n  call 2i   = (b[i], a[i+1], b[i+1]) plane[2i]   penBase - pen[2i]\n  call 2i+1 = (b[i], a[i], a[i+1])   plane[2i+1] penBase - pen[2i+1]\nwith penBase from the OBSERVED distance ladder (dist=cur-winLo:\n>25 -0x545 / 21-25 -0x505 / 16-20 -0x4c5 / 11-15 -0x485 /\n6-10 -0x445 / <=5 -0x405) — pen[2i]/pen[2i+1] stay distinct pairs.\n\ne620/0ca00 semantics preserved: plane distance accumulated in the\nx87 y,x,z,+d order (double stands in for extended precision),\ndist<0 backface skip, dist>=0-or-NaN enters the gate: 0x5414d4==0\nskip, AND-of-three clip-flag bytes trivial reject, OR!=0 clip path.\nEach pass-through emits a copy-safe kRibbonTri (raw pen scalar in\ntag, packed flag bytes in aux, 9 view-space floats — no pointers\ninto ring state). The 0c860 negative-pen LUT remap stays a host\nseam; ordering vs the closed model/sprite path is unchanged (ribbon\ntris precede each bucket''s records + 09a00 flush).\n\nDiagnostics: seams ribbonEmit/planeCull/gate/reject/clip,\ntrailUpdate (be4c), trailMax (window high water), drawListMax\n(64-record arena high water); mdk-inspect --stream-frames adds the\nper-frame rib/rc/cull/rej/clip fields, the ribbon summary line, and\nFNV-1a pen-pair + full-geometry digests.\n\ntest_stream_ribbon: minimum/zero/wrapped windows (span 1 and span\n33 masked exit vs span 32 full window), multi-segment order, tri\ncount/order/winding, distinct pen pairs + six-band ladder, plane\ncull, draw gate, trivial reject, per-vert flag packing, near/side\nclip, arena capacity, copy safety across ring mutation, object\nreap, window slide, teardown/re-init, deterministic replay.\n\nReal data (natural exit): course 0 — 446400 calls / 139162 tris /\n252576 culls / 54662 rejects / 10738 clips, 114 trail updates,\nwindow high water 31, arena 28/64, ovf=0. Course 4 — 338880 calls /\n97740 tris / 193316 culls / 47824 rejects / 8333 clips, 94 updates,\nsame waters, ovf=0. emit+cull+reject+gate = calls on both.\n\nmdk_tests 145846/0, CTest 1/1; traversal L3-8 and freefall c0-c4\ncanonical digests exact, all diag=0. MODE-5 TRAIL / RIBBON ENGINE:\nCLOSED FOR BUILD_A — not full mode-5 closure.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d6266054b3507ad62997127fd6100501cb3f6d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/4d6266054b3507ad62997127fd6100501cb3f6d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/44a241f4c0a772f2a276e29f195220ea56793cec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com