er/health-drain/completion core of the mode-5 frame\n(FUN_0042c8b0 tail + FUN_0042d24c drain) against captured BUILD_A asm:\n\n- Diagnostic-only StreamCompletion first-writer tag (kHero 0x42ca55,\n  kWindow 0x42ca79, kDeath 0x42d95b) — the native latch is a bare\n  monotone dword; the tag records which site transitioned it and is\n  excluded from the canonical state hash.\n- Post-exit latch on step(): the native frame fn returns 1 to the\n  dispatcher and is never re-entered — a second call is now a no-op.\n- STREAM_SCENE.md counter-state inventory: 0x541554 displayed pool\n  (no separate display copy), wall-beat-only drain, skill formulas,\n  non-final clamp / final death arm, 0x4eda9c drain accumulator,\n  the three latch write sites and their frame ordering, the exit\n  handoff, and the HUD-internal accumulators (0x49a8dc blink,\n  0x49a8e0 traversal-only chase — dead in mode 5).\n- mdk-inspect --stream-init: counter line (health/win/fade/latch/\n  reason/exit), per-frame ctr fields, and a deterministic\n  ctr-digest over the completion surface.\n- test_stream_completion: drain boundaries across skills + zero\n  crossing, each writer independently, writer ordering and forced-\n  latch non-attribution, death fade=2.0 handoff, bounded exit,\n  fill 0x00/0xff arms, post-exit idempotence, init/teardown reset.\n\nThe drain/latch/fade code itself was already faithful — this phase\nadds the reason plumbing, the guard, the doc inventory, and the\ntests proving each seam. mdk_tests 10165/0, CTest 1/1, traversal\nsix and freefall five canonicals exact.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e935bef47b8ff0ea51abf6b5f05afcdc5765b4ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/e935bef47b8ff0ea51abf6b5f05afcdc5765b4ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/abd9b71ef60f92820d969c14eddfd8a5579f32c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/abd9b71ef60f92820d969c14eddfd8a5579f32c2","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGFiZDliNzFlZjYwZjkyODIwZDk2OWMxNGVkZGZkOGE1NTc5ZjMyYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/59d5c9843f21a1ad88cf4d3c785afa2272c0c088","sha":"59d5c9843f21a1ad88cf4d3c785afa2272c0c088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/59d5c9843f21a1ad88cf4d3c785afa2272c0c088"}],"sha":"abd9b71ef60f92820d969c14eddfd8a5579f32c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/abd9b71ef60f92820d969c14eddfd8a5579f32c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/59d5c9843f21a1ad88cf4d3c785afa2272c0c088/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:38:45Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T12:38:45Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19A.2D (Cinematic-Core): implement TELETYPE script service\n\nFormat finding (OBSERVED, p19a_teletype.asm + STATS.BNI bytes): there\nis no TELETYPE bytecode in BUILD_A — the boundary is a 4-deep message\nqueue plus a timed two-line text renderer, no opcode dispatch/PC/\nobject/camera operand anywhere in it. The STATS.BNI record named\nTELETYPE is a RIFF WAVE typing-sfx sample, unrelated data.\n\nImplements the three OBSERVED bodies over the flat 0x54b7a4..0x54b834\nblock (kept as one byte arena so the consume loop''s unbounded line\nwrite aliases the trailing scalars/queue like the original — writes\npast the arena clip into a counted seam):\n\n- FUN_0041cf5c init clear: qWrite/qRead/charTimer/holdTimer = 0 only\n- FUN_0041cad0 post: FTI resolve, flags&2 front-push decrements\n  qRead before the resolve (failed push keeps it — OBSERVED quirk),\n  no full check (post onto a full ring overwrites the tail)\n- FUN_0041cb44 service (arg = the 0x5414d4 frame-due flag): entry\n  load+consume with the two-byte \"\\n\" escape (CMP 0x5c/0x6e),\n  localRate dt | f32(dt*2) when a next entry is pending, slide-in\n  ramp 0->0.5 / steady / page-out arms, plain 414d2c vs scaled\n  41518c draw selection on curLine/0x541548, the 0x4999d0&&0x541548\n  suppress gate, and the x87 equal-or-unordered zero tests / integer\n  +-0 hold check / JA clamps / FRNDINT-trunc y coords — all\n  instruction-modeled. Draws surface as kTeletypeDraw events.\n\nMode 5 clears the queue at init and posts no text on the real stream\n(course 0/4: idle arm every frame; tt-digest hash=ec32669a74fcae65,\nposts=0 svc=60 draws=0 ovf=0). Live arms are exercised synthetically.\nThe two 0x541544 stereo re-runs of the service stay untaken (no\nwriters in BUILD_A).\n\nRegression: mdk_tests 9994/0 (new test_stream_teletype covers queue\nmechanics, escapes, flags 0..3, slide/steady/page-out f32 edges,\nsuppress gate, drawEnable=0, zero/negative rates, arena overflow\naliasing, step integration, deterministic ttHash), CTest 1/1,\ntraversal L3-8 and freefall c0-c4 canonical digests unchanged\n(ttHash is folded separately from stateHash).\n\nMODE-5 TELETYPE SCRIPT SERVICE: CLOSED FOR BUILD_A — explicitly not\nthe full mode-5 core.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2fd033c69b9b8bcbd7569a74c9d6d4a56d720da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/a2fd033c69b9b8bcbd7569a74c9d6d4a56d720da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/59d5c9843f21a1ad88cf4d3c785afa2272c0c088","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/59d5c9843f21a1ad88cf4d3c785afa2272c0c088","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDU5ZDVjOTg0M2YyMWExYWQ4OGNmNGQzYzc4NWFmYTIyNzJjMGMwODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/ff722b105485dd19a563c9ef5794deced9005e13","sha":"ff722b105485dd19a563c9ef5794deced9005e13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/ff722b105485dd19a563c9ef5794deced9005e13"}],"sha":"59d5c9843f21a1ad88cf4d3c785afa2272c0c088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/59d5c9843f21a1ad88cf4d3c785afa2272c0c088"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/ff722b105485dd19a563c9ef5794deced9005e13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:03:01Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:03:01Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 19A.2C (Cinematic-Core): implement animator family\n\nImplement the six terminal bodies of FUN_004555bc behind\nStreamScene::animStep, in native dispatch order:\n\n- +0x04==-1 -> classless FUN_00455500 timing tail (rate-free\n  accumulator, record-bound repeat-wrap, no 55890 apply)\n- +0x0c==0x4edcc0 -> class-table fuse arm: +0xdc += f0 frame units,\n  bound via the rec0 +0x10 chain (SAR >>0x10); +0x149&0x40 selects\n  loop-hold at bound-1 vs FUN_0045828c in-place teardown keeping\n  +0x00/+0x60. Ported through a classRec0 sentinel + flattened\n  assets_.animFuseBound (no real mode-5 spawn binds the shared\n  record)\n- latch resync / 0xff00 done-hold\n- null / bounded-fail record\n- ordinary record advance (target clamp, +0x148&8 loop vs\n  frameCount-1 clamp, 55890 apply, done latch)\n- advance + +0x140/+0x144 sound-marker consume -> name-bound\n  kPlaySound event (tag=-1, aux=0x1000e, pos=+0x10)\n\nThe shared driver returns an ObjectAnimBody classification; the\nstream side maps it to per-body seam counters and a per-step\nanimLog trace (slot:body[rec]frame/acc/latch). mdk-inspect\n--stream-frames prints the trace and binds animLimit to the BNI\nimage end so ObjectAnimView walks stay bounded.\n\nReal-data course 0/4 runs dispatch only the advance body (hero\nKURTANIM, pickup SWHANM, escort GUNTANIM); C/F/T/H/N/S bodies are\nsynthetic-only on real streams. State digests are bit-identical to\nthe pre-19A.2C baseline (animator state is not hash-covered).\nDeferred seams unchanged: backdrop/draw/present, teletype, limiter,\nfillSelect internals.\n\nRegression: mdk_tests 9724/0 (new test_stream_animator covers all\nsix bodies, malformed records, NaN acc), CTest 1/1, traversal L3-8\nand freefall c0-c4 canonical digests unchanged.\n\nMODE-5 CINEMATIC ANIMATOR FAMILY: CLOSED FOR BUILD_A — explicitly\nnot the full mode-5 core.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1efdeafd2abc406f4e0bbce92b6e8235fa7cc77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/a1efdeafd2abc406f4e0bbce92b6e8235fa7cc77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/ff722b105485dd19a563c9ef5794deced9005e13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/ff722b105485dd19a563c9ef5794deced9005e13","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGZmNzIyYjEwNTQ4NWRkMTlhNTYzYzllZjU3OTRkZWNlZDkwMDVlMTM","parents