ch order, f80/f32/f64\nintermediate precision, NaN/unordered compare semantics, and\nmigration/reap/anim-call ordering.\n\n- heroUpdate owns winLo progression: migrate(hero/twin, winLo+1) ->\n  winLo_++ -> tunnelExtend(), in the OBSERVED order; swim ease,\n  steer/recentre clamps, offset kicks, wall-probe ricochet,\n  skill-scaled health drain, death/completion latch.\n- genericUpdate: field34-gated advance, trunc migrate, reap-on-fail,\n  frac tail, no anim call.\n- escortUpdate: unconditional advance, animStep, escort-frac rebuild,\n  reap clears the escort slot.\n- pickupUpdate: advance/migrate/anim/rebuild then the hero-distance\n  catch (APPLE, health=0x96, reap, slot clear).\n- strayUpdate: hero-lead clamp (adopts hero field34), trailing\n  pathFrame (zBias-4,-3), reap keeps the stray slot (OBSERVED).\n- twinSync: pos + 48B +0xac transform copy + twin anim tick; zBias\n  deliberately NOT copied (OBSERVED desync).\n\nstep() stages input_/stepDt_ frame context. animStep remains the\ndeferred FUN_004555bc seam (counted, not implemented).\n\nAdds --stream-frames N to --stream-init for a bounded updater-reach\ndiagnostic on real STREAM.BNI data; focused updater tests cover\nevery decoded branch incl. dispatch order and the winLo/tunnelExtend\nboundary. mdk_tests 9662/0, CTest 1/1, traversal L3-L8 and freefall\nc0-c4 canonical digests unchanged.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c2f4ca90c2a43b0353f51b618182c21d4f0128b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/7c2f4ca90c2a43b0353f51b618182c21d4f0128b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/519415745e4335c372574b6f59407e6927174760","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gith