ilently no-ops.\n- mdk-inspect: --stream-init diagnostic (bind census, pool/bucket\n  occupancy, window, seeds, actors, camera, seams, event hash) and\n  bindProto fix — BNI geometry records carry flag as a call-site\n  parameter (FUN_00428400 param_2), so re-head payloads with u32=1\n  like traversalShotModel already does.\n\nmdk_tests 9505/0 (+1250), CTest 1/1, traversal L3-L8 60f digests\nEXACT, freefall c0-c4 digests EXACT, --stream-init clean on real\nBUILD_A data.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nEOF\n)","tree":{"sha":"b391e096f7e08fe5a0029eb984d4ffe55060e7e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/b391e096f7e08fe5a0029eb984d4ffe55060e7e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/94578fdd0d2fca1f289c785d4e18fdaddcef150a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/9