te/fade\nstate, camera/projection globals, injected asset bindings, typed\npresentation events, and a POD snapshot surface for digests.\n\nPhase 19A is NOT closed. Implementation has NOT started:\nstream_scene.cpp remains pending, the object_animation truncation\nfidelity fix (FUN_0047d59a FRNDINT round-toward-zero vs lroundf)\nremains pending, and real-data cinematic goldens remain pending.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c4232ae4d60c626e16d5a7045431f309b425be1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/1c4232ae4d60c626e16d5a7045431f309b425be1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/4f96f2553ddc954394b1ef0788db818481fec113","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/4f96f2553ddc954394b1ef0788db818481fec113","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDRmOTZmMjU1M2RkYzk1ND