\STATS.* — STATS.BNI/MTI belong to\n  the mode-6 init FUN_00429200 (statistics/briefing screen) and\n  have no other code reference.\n- Mode 5 = steerable procedural tunnel flight (FUN_0042be4c\n  generator, 32-node path ring, 32-bucket object ring over the\n  SHARED 399-record 0x32e pool, FUN_0042dc68 path-lerp camera,\n  FUN_0042e100 back-to-front ribbon+object pass, FUN_0042e684\n  parallax backdrop, FUN_0042d24c hero steering + wall-collision\n  health drain, BONES-dock completion, scripted white/black fades).\n- 0x4edad4/d8/dc = tunnel-shape params seeded f(course,skill),\n  not score counters.\n- Mode 8 = separate video pipeline: FUN_0047b0fc loads\n  MISC\\FLIC\\MDKEND.FLC (progress bar + FINISH.BNI WAV bank),\n  FUN_0047b3f4 pumps FUN_00414158 (bounded chunked FLIC decoder,\n  handler table 0x49a750) with the frame-mark SFX/palette script,\n  FUN_0047b674 then plays MISC\\FLIC\\MDKBZK.MVE via the 0x489xxx\n  callback MVE player, then frontend. No shared scene engine —\n  only generic plumbing (limiter/fb/palette/present).\n- New contract doc docs/reverse-engineering/STREAM_SCENE.md;\n  EXECUTABLE_MAP + journal + audit corrected.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8010bd7fd09098da45c3dbffb63eaa0f33faef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/d8010bd7fd09098da45c3dbffb63eaa0f33faef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/006a1d01149ef09ab9b75062e9ce975e1b627fd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github