r inside\n  the bracket draw, matching the original''s cadence.\n- frontend_host: saveListLbbImage lazy cache (six slots).\n- frontend_resources: INTRO1A decode at load (optional — absent\n  record skips playback instead of the original''s crash).\n\nGodot bridge + presentation:\n- gif_decode.*: corpus-shaped GIF87a/89a decoder (single\n  full-frame 600x360 image, GCT only, non-interlaced, LZW with\n  the KwKwK fix). Verified pixel+palette-exact vs PIL on all 10\n  MDKS_* corpus slides.\n- frontend_presenter: attract slides replace the framebuffer\n  (strings hidden at state 1, drawn over for >=2, ARROW always);\n  the INTRO1A transition frame under the blended palette; the\n  OBSERVED save-list draw block (rows x=0x62 step 0x10, SVOPT1\n  centered y=0x1f, SVOPT3 empty at y=0x64, SVBAD (0xa,0x162),\n  THMB (0x1a2,0x67), LBB (0x1c2-w/2,0x67), palette merge\n  DAC[0..63]=SYS_PAL head / [64..255]=preview).\n- mdk_bridge: frontend_frame(transition_ms), frontend_transition_\n  seconds/complete, frontend_capture_thumbnail (traversal arms\n  sample rt.hud.fb under the active palette — the port''s bounded\n  seam since no indexed world buffer exists; frontend arms sample\n  the last composed frame); staged THMB rides SaveWriteInput /\n  SaveWriteFullInput.thumbnail.\n- main.gd: transition window (key-edge skip = 0x54b57c, elapsed\n  timeline completion, input swallowed while the transition owns\n  the frame); THUMB_GRAB fx capture; FrontendThmb overlay node\n  dropped (THMB now draws inside the indexed frame).\n- main.tscn: obsolete FrontendThmb node removed.\n\nTests: LBB decode/loader + level map, THMB capture geometry +\nsave round-trip, INTRO1A RLE + palette timeline, GIF decode\n(literals, KwKwK, every non-corpus rejection). 6280 native +\n77 frontend checks, 0 failures.\n\nDocs: EXECUTABLE_MAP Phase 18B.2B evidence block, SAVE_FORMAT\nTHMB capture paragraph, audit G7 note updated. Frontend music +\nambience remain deferred.\n\nFRONTEND NON-AUDIO PRESENTATION: CLOSED F