.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/de49a387405f23c301106ea35f7df36f8e39b699"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/2599c64fb33f7e602d89ba131047a2bb3f1a6291/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:51:39Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:51:39Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 18B.2A (Presentation): render core frontend menu flow\n\nMakes the already-closed FrontendShell + host services usable from\nthe Godot frontend. GDScript presents and routes only — no menu\nstate machine is duplicated outside the authoritative C++ shell.\n\n- src/core/frontend_resources.{h,cpp}: shared loader extracted from\n  the SDL app (MDKOPT backdrop, FONTBIG/FONTSML, ARROW, OPT0-4,\n  OM_*/DSP_*/SND_*/JOY_*/M_*/KM_*/LANG rows, OPTSTRT/SVOPT1-3/\n  SV_TITLE/SV_ASK/SVBAD/SV_FAIL/PAUSED/ABORT1-3/HELP_* records,\n  SYS_PAL head). application.cpp now consumes the shared loader.\n- frontend_presenter.{h,cpp}: composes the 600x360 indexed frame —\n  root/options/children through the existing core renderers, save\n  list / save-name / abort / help / pause through the overlay\n  records; existing THMB blits only (no new capture); header-only\n  saves present metadata only (LOAD_*.LBB UNKNOWN); deterministic\n  LCG noise placeholder for the armed transition.\n- MdkBridge: frontend_frame() RGBA dict (+ THMB overlay rect),\n  frontend_progression_step() mode 5-8 pump (mode 8 arg!=0 picks\n  fresh vs returning entry by origin mode), feRes_ bound at boot.\n- main.gd: --frontend launcher, the section-2 loop\n  (update -> dispatch -> fx -> ack -> frame -> end_frame), full\n  input dictionary incl. raw_edges/typed bytes, FrontendLayer\n  visibility switching, transition timer -> transition_complete.\n- main.tscn: FrontendLayer + FrontendRect + FrontendThmb.\n- _run_smoke_frontend: bounded A-O scenarios — boot/nav/New Game/\n  Continue/save list/inspect/name seam/options/skill/help/abort/\n  transition/visibility/temp-save safety. Mirrors the OBSERVED\n  in-game-only F-key gate and the same-frame Esc abort self-cancel;\n  press cadence honors the +30 first-repeat deadline (release\n  between presses).\n- _run_smoke_real_saves (--smoke-real-saves): read-only installed\n  SAVES corpus check — full 1.SAV (+THMB record) and header-only\n  2.SAV, directory fingerprint unchanged.\n- pytest: GodotFrontendMenu class wires both smokes.\n\nDeferred (unchanged seams): attract MDKS_* slides, new THMB\ncapture, menu music/ambience, legacy joystick/perf screens.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f8ebaa3e23ab228e2cbc3a0ce9490faef5e4c23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/4f8ebaa3e23ab228e2cbc3a0ce9490faef5e4c23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/2599c64fb33f7e602d89ba131047a2bb3f1a6291","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"u