l":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/83c5853a931e4f82ac68e82534ccec53ecb69ee8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:32:30Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:32:30Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 18B.1 (Frontend): implement host and save services\n\nFrontendHostServices binds an explicit writable save root (production:\nthe runtime SAVES dir; tests/diagnostic: temp roots) plus a read-only\nDataRoot for the MISC\\MDKS_* slide probe, implementing the five\nPhase-18A seams the shell consumes via makeSeams():\n\n- lastGameExists    FUN_00428290 -> FUN_00426618 -> FUN_004264f0:\n                    openable AND envelope-consistent, no packet walk\n- enumerateSaves    FUN_004202cc''s \"*.SAV\" scan, unbounded,\n                    case-folded ext, byte-sorted raw names\n- inspectSlot(Detail) FUN_00428144 via the new saveGameInspectHead:\n                    envelope + clear SAVE + THMB + GAME expect-reads,\n                    no FUN_004278c0 range checks, no tail read; the\n                    detail form returns the raw 3648B THMB + SaveError\n- writeSaveFile     FUN_00422d84''s filesystem half: verbatim stem,\n                    escape refused, bytes from the embedder''s\n                    FrontendSaveSource; header-only routes through\n                    saveGameWriteHeaderOnly, full through\n                    embedder-supplied saveGameWriteFull output;\n                    unproducible bytes keep the dialog open (OBSERVED)\n- slideProbe        MISC\\MDKS_%03d.GIF header probe + the OBSERVED\n                    600x360 gate; raw bytes via slideData; no GIF\n                    decode in core (external format)\n\nTransition seam: frontendHostTransitionArmed/Complete own the\nDAT_0049aa8c blend gate + the FUN_0041ebf4 clear of DAT_0054152c\nEsc suppression.\n\nsave_game.{h,cpp}: saveGameEnvelopeValid(File) + saveGameInspectHead\n(File) + kUnexpectedTag. mdk_bridge gains the presentation-neutral\nhost surface (boot/enter/update/end_frame/snapshot/drain_*/host\nseams/frontend_dispatch_requests) with an explicit host-owned vs\napp/presentation-owned request boundary. mdk-inspect\n--frontend-script now runs real seams: read-only corpus probes with\n--data-path, real temp-root writes otherwise.\n\nTests (+109, mdk_tests 6226/0): temp-root integration, envelope/head\ninspect edge cases, enumeration, LASTGAME, both writers, save-name\ncommit/overwrite, escape refusal, slide probes, transition ack, the\nGUNT_10 mid-fight manual-save gate (mode 3 + live X_STRIKE -> F2 does\nnot arm) and the mode-5 autosave bypass with a real 3.SAV write.\n\nTraversal L3-L8 60f + freefall c0-c4 digests EXACT. CTest 1/1,\nmdk_frontend_tests 60/0, mdkbridge builds clean.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0b76ab859c9041eb194ea34479ae2d917874c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/b0b76ab859c9041eb194ea34479ae2d917874c48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/83c5853a931e4f82ac68e82534ccec53ecb69ee8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/83c5853a931e4f82ac68e82534ccec53ecb69ee8","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDgzYzU4NTNhOTMxZTRmODJhYzY4ZTgyNTM0Y2NlYzUzZWNiNjllZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/9dfa13baeb483565e52d16c88e1945f1fadd8d7a","sha":"9dfa13baeb483565e52d16c88e1945f1fadd8d7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/9dfa13baeb483565e52d16c88e1945f1fadd8d7a"}],"sha":"83c5853a931e4f82ac68e82534ccec53ecb69ee8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/83c5853a931e4f82ac68e82534ccec53ecb69ee8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/9dfa13baeb483565e52d16c88e1945f1fadd8d7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:52:59Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:52:59Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 18A (Frontend-RE): reconstruct menu and save-slot semantics\n\nReconstruct the BUILD_A frontend state machine from the original\nbinary and implement the native frontend shell contract:\n\n- mode/sub-mode machine (DAT_00541492/93): loop-head mouse accumulate\n  + tick, pause block, idle counter, Esc abort arm, F1>F2>F3>F10>F11>\n  F12 overlay chain, same-frame dispatch of just-armed overlays,\n  primary-mode fallthrough only at sub 0.\n- Root menu (FUN_0041dc90) attract/slideshow state (FUN_0041ef74):\n  5.0/4.0/2.0 s idle thresholds, MDKS_%03d.GIF probe seam, -1 sticky\n  disable, blend gate.\n- Save list (sub 1): stem truncation, clamped nav, 13-row window,\n  lazy header inspect, invalid-entry-exits quirk, FUN_0042056c\n  arg-split teardown semantics.\n- Save name entry (sub 8): manual gate (mode 3 + sub 0 + flags + no\n  X_STRIKE — retail cannot save mid-fight), autosave confirm phase,\n  overwrite-at-cursor editing, cursor>=1 Enter quirk, header-only\n  autosave writes.\n- Abort console (sub 9): Y/N edges, wrap selection, mode-dependent\n  yes/no teardowns.\n- FrontendShell request queue + FrontendFx host events + host seams\n  (lastGameExists/enumerateSaves/inspectSlot/writeSave/slideProbe) —\n  the core never touches the filesystem.\n- mdk-inspect --frontend-script: deterministic scripted-input\n  diagnostic over the shell.\n- +150 native checks; traversal 6/6 + freefall 5/5 digests exact.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"22786af7c20271fd7902afd09701e1932f99c407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/22786af7c20271fd7902afd09701e1932f99c407"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/9dfa13baeb483565e52d16c88e1945f1fadd8d7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/9dfa13baeb483565e52d16c88e1945f1fadd8d7a","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDlkZmExM2JhZWI0ODM1NjVlNTJkMTZjODhlMTk0NWYxZmFkZDhkN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/5c4c991a2622e129b9bd132ab271345c11e6f22f","sha":"5c4c991a2622e129b9bd132ab271345c11e6f22f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/5c4c991a2622e129b9bd132ab271345c11e6f22f"}],"sha":"9dfa13baeb483565e52d16c88e1945f1fadd8d7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/9dfa13baeb483565e52d16c88e1945f1fadd8d7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/5c4c991a2622e129b9bd132ab271345c11e6f22f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:29:40Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T06:29:40Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 17C.2 (Audio): play authoritative traversal SFX in Godot\n\nConsume the Phase 17C.1 rt.audioFx contract and produce real audible\nplayback without touching gameplay/core semantics.\n\n- core/sni_wave.{h,cpp}: evidence-bounded RIFF/WAVE decoder for SNI\n  record payloads (PCM tag 1, mono, 8/16-bit, authored rate + bytes\n  verbatim; structured statuses, synthetic fixtures only).\n- core/traversal_audio_dsp.{h,cpp}: instruction-exact port of the\n  FUN_0040282c \"2D\" (linear 20..250 falloff, basis pan, doppler\n  30/(f*1100) clamp [0.25,3]) and FUN_00402b00 \"3D\" (zoom-scaled\n  aperture cone, behind-listener silence, 1.3 center boost quirk)\n  updaters, plus the FUN_0040202c/046c27c/046c2ec volume/pan/freq\n  domain conversions. Global-mode select via the scope-enter edge\n  (transitionPhase); +0x9 latch and +0x24=-1.0 first-tick sentinel\n  preserved.\n- core/traversal_audio_mixer.{h,cpp}: the 63-instance pool —\n  first-free alloc, no stealing, name-scoped ensure/restart/stop,\n  owner-slot replacement with orphan persistence, live-pos (0x20000)\n  owner tracking, DS-playhead natural finish, drain-once command\n  batch.\n- mdk_bridge: loads LEVELnS.SNI + TRAVERSE.SNI + MDKSOUND.SNI in the\n  observed record order, decodes/caches AudioStreamWAV by name\n  (music-class records excluded), feeds listener state from\n  camera.pose.basis/zoom/timing.smoothed, resolves owner positions\n  through live DynamicObject storage, exposes drain_audio_fx +\n  get_audio_stats.\n- main.gd: 63 AudioStreamPlayer slots, one AudioEffectPanner bus per\n  voice (no Godot distance model), drains in _process and _step_n,\n  clears voices on restore/reload/mode-flip/exit. No audio state is\n  serialized.\n- tests: +115 native checks (decoder, updater math, pool semantics —\n  incl. the orphan-vs-binding regression), smoke assertions on the\n  L3 canonical + L6/L8 combat paths.\n\nValidated: mdk_tests 5967/0, CTest 1/1, pytest 25/25 (L3 canonical,\nL6/L8 combat, save-restore, freefall c0/c2/c4), all six 60f traversal\ndigests + five freefall digests exact. L3 smoke plays FOOT3/4, LAND,\nSNIPERON/OFF, SNIPERSHOT, RICO2, GRUNTFIRE (live-pos) — resolved=27,\nmissing=0, pool bounded. Zone-ambient crossfade and music stay\ndeferred.\n\nTRAVERSAL SFX PLAYBACK: CLOSED FOR BUILD_A\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"84dddc73e8697194750c49a26155fee288f428da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/84dddc73e8697194750c49a26155fee288f428da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/5c4c991a2622e129b9bd132ab271345c11e6f22f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/5c4c991a2622e129b9bd132ab271345c11e6f22f","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDVjNGM5OTFhMjYyMmUxMjliOWJkMTMyYWIyNzEzNDVjMTFlNmYyMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/494c51317cfbfc8e3c20f59bd59a062c3e4eabe2","sha":"494c51317cfbfc8e3c20f59bd59a062c3e4eabe2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/494c51317cfbfc8e3c20f59bd59a062c3e4eabe2"}],"sha":"5c4c991a2622e129b9bd132ab271345c11e6f22f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/5c4c991a2622e129b9bd132ab271345c11e6f22f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/494c51317cfbfc8e3c20f59bd59a062c3e4eabe2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T04:33:06Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T04:33:06Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 17C.1 follow-up: name-scoped ops + FUN_00402160 mode word\n\n- FUN_00402658/FUN_0040210c are name-scoped (instance match by\n  record ptr at node+0x28; active = flags&0xc0==0) — drop the\n  owner=kPlayer tags from ensure/stop emits; owner identity only\n  exists on owner-slot ops (FUN_00402160/FUN_00402288/FUN_004020b4).\n- Carry the observed FUN_00402160 mode word (inst+0x8) on positional\n  events: 0x1000e anim/ALERT, 0x2000e voice (+0x158 slot), 0x10106\n  impacts, 0x10006 EXPLODE remnant. Folded into the mdk-inspect\n  audio digest + sample print.\n- Test fix: Abank helper reserves up front — vector realloc was\n  dangling animTables pointers (the intermittent SIGBUS).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":