8028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/a95dc6cf93d699243944b65e99cd246e70308c21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T04:24:08Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T04:24:21Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 17C.1 (Audio-RE): reconstruct traversal audio contract\n\nReconstruct reachable BUILD_A sound semantics without implementing\nGodot playback (Phase 17C.2).\n\n- core/traversal_audio.{h,cpp}: presentation-neutral drain-once event\n  contract (rt.audioFx + monotonic rt.audioSeq), one event per original\n  FUN_00402xxx callsite. Name-scoped ops (play/ensure/restart/stop)\n  mirror FUN_00402658/FUN_0040210c record matching; owner identity only\n  on positional spawn/release where the original binds an owner slot.\n- Emitters wired at the ported callsites: footsteps (latch 0x49b924\n  pair-select: !=0 -> FOOT1/FOOT2, ==0 -> FOOT3/FOOT4, toggling on the\n  second crossing), LAND, CHUTEOUT/CHUTEON(ensure)/CHUTEIN, SNIPERON/\n  SNIPEROFF/BREATH, ZOOM ramp loop (ensure while ramping, stop at\n  floor/ceiling/idle/teardown), RASPBER deny, SNIPERSHOT, gated\n  RICO1-3 rand pick (mode>1 || frame&3), CMI-named object impacts,\n  EXPLODE, ALERT/RUNNER, object voice spawn/release, op-0x59 sfx modes.\n- mdk-inspect: bounded audio diagnostic (op census + deterministic\n  digest over seq/op/name/quantized-pos, <=16 samples, no ownerKey).\n- tests: +61 checks covering emit/seq/drain-once, footstep pair latch,\n  chute ensure->stop->CHUTEIN refire latch, scope transitions, obj anim\n  sound consume, op-0x59/0x6b script audio, positional owner tokens.\n\nVerified: 5851/0 checks, CTest 1/1, six traversal digests + five\nfreefall canonical digests unchanged.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bdf6b1fdb6a584b320477edd7ad1a483ca21ddf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/bdf6b1fdb6a584b320477edd7ad1a483ca21ddf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/a95dc6cf93d699243944b65e99cd246e70308c21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: