thor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/644adab34ce7f84ab55a72ecf487fe42fdd6bbb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T02:12:39Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T02:12:39Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 17B.2 (Presentation): render traversal HUD and view modes\n\nPresent the already-closed native traversal HUD contract in Godot\nwithout moving any semantics out of the core.\n\nBridge: get_hud_snapshot() copies the composed 600x360 indexed fb,\nthe active palette key, the raw 640x480 SNIPERS1 bezel, the scope /\nsniper-view / shot-window gates, the authored view and aperture\nrects, and scalar echoes for diagnostics. Two persistent\npalette-expanded ImageTextures (overlay + bezel) re-upload only\nwhen the (content, palette) pair changes and are dropped in\nshutdown().\n\nFrontend: BezelLayer(2) < ScopeLayer(3) < ShotCamLayer(4) <\nHudLayer(5) < Fade(6). The overlay presents the core-composed\nbuffer verbatim (pen 0 transparent, nearest, full-window map); the\nbezel is shown only while the native sniper_view gate is open,\nplaced so its fb region lands on the window via the (20,55)\nhypothesis offset; the 384x280 scope SubViewport shares the main\nworld and mirrors the core camera pose. HUD surfaces are hidden on\nfreefall, restore, and level-transition boundaries.\n\nSmoke: canonical 60f input stream reproduces the composed digest\n36e1ab03a2f649ab through the bridge; asserts cover pen-0\ntransparency, palette expansion, texture reuse, bezel dims,\nscope enter/exit, death/health echoes, freefall absence, and\npost-restore/post-reload rebuild.","tree":{"sha":"49f13ebae0fbfdbbad8bc3a22398138b8229d11a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/49f13ebae0fbfdbbad8bc3a22398138b8229d11a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/644adab34ce7f84ab55a72ecf487fe42fdd6bbb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/644adab34ce7f84ab55a72ecf487fe42fdd6bbb6","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKDY0NGFkYWIzNGNlN2Y4NGFiNTVhNzJlY2Y0ODdmZTQyZmRkNmJiYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/e3fa568d17742af1e2a91ffad4b43ac549136741","sha":"e3fa568d17742af1e2a91ffad4b43ac549136741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/e3fa568d17742af1e2a91ffad4b43ac549136741"}],"sha":"644adab34ce7f84ab55a72ecf487fe42fdd6bbb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/644adab34ce7f84ab55a72ecf487fe42fdd6bbb6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/e3fa568d17742af1e2a91ffad4b43ac549136741/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T00:29:35Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T00:29:35Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 17B.1 (HUD-Core): close traversal HUD compositor\n\nAdds the closeout surface only — no new HUD features:\n\n- mdk-inspect --traversal-runtime prints a `hud:` diagnostic line:\n  level id, bound/missing record census (25 slots), viewport-mode\n  counter, scope flags, health/blink, weapon select, ammo, inventory\n  FSM, mission timer + wedge latch, event bars, SKULL gate, HUD seam\n  counters, fb dims, nonzero pen count, and a deterministic\n  FNV-1a64 digest over the composed pen-index overlay.\n- Bounds/malformed test coverage: truncated sprite stream rejection,\n  fully/partially off-screen sprite clipping, unbound-runtime compose.\n- Docs: Phase 17B.1 closeout record (sec.227), implementation status\n  preamble, corrections (81000 init constant, 0x540d9b bit7 select,\n  float-precision wedge compares, even-frame damage suppression).\n\nReal-data validation (60f scripted runs, deterministic across\nrepeats): L3/L6/L8 all bind 25/0, vpm=60, timer ticks 54000->53940,\nnz=4097, HUD digest 36e1ab03a2f649ab each.\n\nmdk_tests 5790/0, CTest 1/1. All six traversal canonical digests\nremain EXACT (diag=0); the composed-buffer digest is a separate\npresentation-only checksum — gameplay fold untouched.\n\nTRAVERSAL HUD CORE: CLOSED FOR BUILD_A.\nGodot HUD presentation (Phase 17B.2) is NOT started.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3396ec626b5a6ad78dcd2be3ed4f38fe5bd2bc21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/3396ec626b5a6ad78dcd2be3ed4f38fe5bd2bc21"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/e3fa568d17742af1e2a91ffad4b43ac549136741","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/e3fa568d17742af1e2a91ffad4b43ac549136741","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGUzZmE1NjhkMTc3NDJhZjFlMmE5MWZmYWQ0YjQzYWM1NDkxMzY3NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/9610635e0e5d565cc1476e594bf997182e37ca4b","sha":"9610635e0e5d565cc1476e594bf997182e37ca4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/9610635e0e5d565cc1476e594bf997182e37ca4b"}],"sha":"e3fa568d17742af1e2a91ffad4b43ac549136741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/e3fa568d17742af1e2a91ffad4b43ac549136741"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/9610635e0e5d565cc1476e594bf997182e37ca4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:58:32Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:58:32Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 17B.1 checkpoint: traversal HUD core implementation\n\nPhase 17B.1 is NOT yet closed — this is an intermediate checkpoint.\n\nImplemented (native/core only):\n\n- core HUD compositor in the observed FUN_00436d60 draw order\n  (gate-A fills -> inventory -> gate-B gauges/CROSS/SNIPERS2 ->\n  reticle -> event bars -> pie/digits -> scoped tail -> msg seam ->\n  SKULL)\n- TRAVSPRT.BNI record/image/sprite-table binds (21-name table)\n  and FONTBIG from MISC/MDKFONT.FTI\n- SNIPERS2 u16 stream decoder (dword-count literals, <=3-byte\n  0xffNN inlines, 216000 px verified against real data)\n- health digits + low-health blink, weapon/ammo panel, RNG latch,\n  zoom% tail, inventory FSM (timer/lerp/id-6 sync/box/icons),\n  event bars, mission timer (difficulty init + fixed -1.0 tick +\n  expiry), SKULL death overlay (DDA scaled blit)\n- projector selector wired as a counted viewport seam; +0xf4\n  remnant-tick behavior implemented\n- mission pie wedge stamp (FUN_004182a0/00418378) with the\n  float-precision boundary constants the originals compare against\n\nfield541498 corrected to level-id semantics (OBSERVED 0x433d77\nindexes the 0x4999e8 level table); all existing readers audited —\nenemy medium-damp and the weapon-5 >3 latch compares were already\ncorrect; only stale comments changed.\n\nGameplay canonical digests (60f, L3-L8) remain EXACT:\n25766a67ce50ea46 950219ddeae8b679 2379f7e90204e671\n5686edbf38de3fda 57bdd179a944a4c9 2edeb4aa6c7ef486\n\