ommand grammar,\n  SNIPERS2 overlay, SNIPERS1 bezel-under-fb layering, CROSS draw.\n- Health pie/digits, weapon/ammo scoped tail, event bars, SKULL\n  death overlay, mounted reticle, and the mission timer contract\n  decoded (FUN_00417e20/00436f2c/0046911c/00469f7c/0041b654).\n- Deferred seams documented: 0x540b20 shade LUT (inventory-cell\n  darken), FUN_00437aa8 scope warp, FUN_0041cb44 message flush,\n  scope-entry palette fades.\n- Godot smoke validation pending: one direct Godot --smoke process\n  hung at baseline (3h52m elapsed vs ~1m CPU) and was terminated;\n  a bounded baseline smoke must be verified before Phase 17B\n  Godot-side validation claims.\n\nVerified: mdk_tests 5679 checks / 0 failures, CTest 1/1.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed371f39667d1ca56ea413f68ca1a21bbe03430e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/ed371f39667d1ca56ea413f68ca1a21bbe03430e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/562f3a3d8415d847bfb0d582f5e06d30b7c10603","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/s