6-09-28T12:44:18Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 17A (Presentation): close traversal combat rendering\n\nAdd save_game_full()/restore_save() bridge entry points that reuse the\ncore full-save writer and applyFullSaveToTraversal restore path, tear\ndown all Godot presentation/transient state across a restore, and\nrebuild shots/objects/arenas/palette from authoritative BULL/ALIE/AREN\nstate. Validate combat presentation on LEVEL6 (OLYM_1) and LEVEL8\n(GUNT_1), add a save->restore golden (restored projectile, no stale FX\nreplay, one-shot post-restore events), a scripted --combat-demo for the\nreal renderer, and pytest coverage. No serialized presentation state;\ncore save format and gameplay semantics unchanged.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e6c8c4eb5bfbb5d95401407b4272aca2f78596b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/0e6c8c4eb5bfbb5d95401407b4272aca2f78596b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/613cc25cc012536616c655633af32261177d2e2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://a