t":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:56:58Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"docs: pin Freefall canonical digest invocation (skill 1)\n\nThe c0-c4 canonical digests (ba5ffd4ee90e6d10 / 2bdb2d0406748d28 /\na2dee1b1ed981475 / 8fa58b04419ad8d8 / 3c5867b3e7901c8c) were never\nstale — they reproduce verbatim on current HEAD and on the pre-17A\ncommit d0f9d84 under the canonical invocation:\n\n  mdk-inspect --data-path <installed> --freefall-runtime\n    FALL3D/FALL3D.BNI --course N --skill 1 --seed 12648430\n    --frames 1200\n\nskill 1 is the canonical skill (the mdk-inspect default is 0, which\nyields a different — but also deterministic — digest set); seed is\n0xC0FFEE; each course stops at finished on frame 1141. The doc now\nrecords the full invocation so the canonical set is reproducible\nwithout archaeology.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"08622d17c452e3f850f1111bb9b201fa73fe96d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/08622d17c452e3f850f1111bb9b201fa73fe96d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/c567a9aa98e038a92d8f86701cea2872737dbd96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","rep