or":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:54:58Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T11:54:58Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 17A test: stabilize combat texture cache invariant\n\nThe damage/death smoke check used an arbitrary <64 bound on Kurt\ntexture-cache growth. Measured against the real contract, the window\nlegitimately requests ~111 unique {palette,table,frame} keys\n(tumble/death frame diversity is RNG-order dependent), so the bound\nflaked at 52/101/119.\n\nReplace with the observed invariants, measured from the keys each\nsnapshot actually requests:\n\n- cache growth <= unique requested keys (no unrequested entries,\n  no duplicate inserts)\n- cache size <= 4096 (the implementation''s real bound)\n- a repeated snapshot with no step adds zero entries (same-key\n  reuse)\n- a replay window adds at most the genuinely-new key set\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5166b492f1234dfb748c3fea69d3e472608650cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/5166b492f1234dfb748c3fea69d3e472608650cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/cbcc4ed2835abe1b43835cb973cdcea2db623bbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","