it/commits/d89be471603a261d6bff09b90e43e46eee027a79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/d89be471603a261d6bff09b90e43e46eee027a79","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGQ4OWJlNDcxNjAzYTI2MWQ2YmZmMDliOTBlNDNlNDZlZWUwMjdhNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/df75b3063f44ec3e364001c147ed73e33d260445","sha":"df75b3063f44ec3e364001c147ed73e33d260445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/df75b3063f44ec3e364001c147ed73e33d260445"}],"sha":"d89be471603a261d6bff09b90e43e46eee027a79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/d89be471603a261d6bff09b90e43e46eee027a79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/df75b3063f44ec3e364001c147ed73e33d260445/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:58:53Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:58:53Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 16B (Presentation): render authoritative Kurt sprites in Godot\n\nRender the already-authoritative traversal Kurt sprite pipeline in\nthe Godot frontend — real TRAVSPRT.BNI / LEVEL<n>S.SNI frames at the\noriginal projected screen anchor, replacing the debug proxy as the\ndefault player presentation.\n\nCore (src/core):\n- fti_sprite: decodeSpriteTable — the K_ record form ({u32 count,\n  u32 ofs[N] relative to +0, frames {w,h,s16 hot,s16 hot,RLE}}),\n  sharing the FTI frame-table walk; the bound record lands on the\n  count word (BNI payload+4 / SNI sentinel payload+4).\n- player_animation: playerAnimRegistration — FUN_00431300''s\n  player-entry half: the M1 transform + installed mode-0 projector\n  (sx=(x''+z'')/z''*299.95+0.05, sy=(y''+z'')/z''*180.4+0.05; near-clip\n  z''<0.05 flags 0x10, the 0x540c4c/50 anchor ints (skipped while\n  fieldDa0 latches, matching the original''s stale-write behavior),\n  and the pos+(0,0,1) probe writing 0x540dbc = rint(sy2 - anchorY)\n  (the signed pixels-per-unit scale — OBSERVED negative on spawn).\n  The job-registration gate (c9c&&ca0 | e6c&&e70&0x20) is shared\n  with the callback''s head gate.\n- traversal_runtime: rt.hudActive = 1 per presented frame (the\n  0x5414d4 pacing latch the draw gate reads — the slow-frame\n  catch-up path that clears it is not modeled); registration runs\n  before the anim callback, matching the original call order;\n  TraversalFrameResult carries anchor/scope/scale/depth/view/\n  screen/probe/clip/registered + overlay frame identity + jitter\n  offsets + muzzle index.\n- mdk_inspect: pin the animDrawn fold slot to 0 — it is a\n  presentation-only live bit; pinning reproduces all six canonical\n  digests byte-identical (verified).\n\nBridge (gdextension):\n- decode all 29 bound K_ tables at level load (TRAVSPRT.BNI 23;\n  LEVEL<n>S.SNI sentinels 0..6 depending on level), tracked decode\n  errors, missing-name counts.\n- get_kurt_snapshot(): the verbatim result fields + resolved\n  main/overlay frame dicts {table, name, frame, w, h, hot, tex}.\n- Texture cache keyed {palette digest, table, frame}; lazily expands\n  the RLE stream into palette-mapped RGBA (FUN_00415ff0 semantics:\n  literal/run packets, index-0 transparent, 0xfe row, 0xff end),\n  nearest-filtered, bounded at 4096 entries; cleared on level\n  unload. Sprite palette = the displayed arena''s composed palette\n  (level-palette fallback).\n\nGodot (main.tscn/main.gd):\n- KurtLayer canvas + KurtViewport: KurtOverlay then KurtMain\n  TextureRects (the original draws overlay FIRST at anchor+jitter,\n  then main — FUN_00409724''s order). Anchor = (0x540c4c, 0x540d34 +\n  0x540c50); dest = anchor - hotspot; FUN_00415ff0''s entry rejects\n  (fully outside, or right-edge all-or-nothing) applied in 600x360\n  space, mapped to the window by independent x/y ratios.\n- The old capsule/marker/wire proxy is hidden by default; F4 toggles\n  it as a dev aid. F3 diag label gains anim/overlay/anchor/scale.\n- No second projection, no sprite scaling (dbc feeds scope/HUD, not\n  sprite size), no Godot-side animation inference.\n\nSmoke coverage (all 0 failures):\n- idle K_IDLE, corridor run K_RUN, strafe K_SIDE, airborne\n  K_JUMP/K_FALL, landing K_LAND, standing fire K_SHOT/K_RUNFIR,\n  turn+fire K_TRN45 + K_MUZZF overlay (0x12c shot branch correctly\n  has no muzzle — OBSERVED), texture reuse, overlay-before-main\n  order, proxy hidden, anchor bounds, signed scale formula,\n  HMO_9 XGS vs the real deepFloorZ-200 kill plane (survives),\n  LEVEL6/LEVEL8 generic presentation + object checks.\n\nValidation: mdk_tests 5452/0; CTest 1/1; pytest 19/0; traversal\nLEVEL3-8 diag=0 with all six canonical digests unchanged.\n\nSeam noted: the FUN_00463608 tumble/death post block (the\n0x540d5c accumulator crossing 5.0 -> 0x385/0x3ea at\n0x463f9d..0x46422f) remains an unported gameplay seam — the anim\nstates and frame selection are ported and unit-tested natively; the\npresentation path is table-agnostic and would render K_BANG/K_BFLIP\nthe moment core selects them.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nEOF\n)","tree":{"sha":"d345dc6ecc9c35232c71e4cb43af5ef472b66695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/d345dc6ecc9c35232c71e4cb43af5ef472b66695"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/df75b3063f44ec3e364001c147ed73e33d260445","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/df75b3063f44ec3e364001c147ed73e33d260445","node_id":"C_kwDOUdj5udoAKGRmNzViMzA2M2Y0NGVjM2UzNjQwMDFjMTQ3ZWQ3M2UzM2QyNjA0NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/f855a5ebc047362f2599d2582b60c8d984edf48f","sha":"f855a5ebc047362f2599d2582b60c8d984edf48f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/f855a5ebc047362f2599d2582b60c8d984edf48f"}],"sha":"df75b3063f44ec3e364001c147ed73e33d260445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/df75b3063f44ec3e364001c147ed73e33d260445"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/f855a5ebc047362f2599d2582b60c8d984edf48f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:45:19Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T14:45:19Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 16A.1 (Player-RE): close Kurt animation residual seams\n\nCloses the two explicit residual seams from Phase 16A.\n\n0x2bd release query — now OBSERVED, previously UNKNOWN. The\nrelease path (jumpSustain==0) calls FUN_00402658(0x54c604) every\nframe: it walks the live sound-instance list 0x49ff90 and returns\nnonzero while CHUTEON is playing. When true it stops the loop\n(FUN_0040210c) and fires CHUTEIN (FUN_004022b8). The sound-object\nname binds prove the semantics: 0x4974ac CHUTEOUT->0x54c5fc\n(deploy), 0x4974b8 CHUTEIN->0x54c600 (release), 0x4974c0\nCHUTEON->0x54c604 (sustain loop), 0x4974c8 LAND->0x54c608,\n0x4974d0.. FOOT1-4->0x54c60c..0x54c618. The sustain path''s\nFUN_00402388(0x54c604,0) is an ensure-playing pump, so the refire\npair fires exactly once — the first release frame after >=1\nsustain frame — then the query turns false. The 0x320 mantle\nenter also stops CHUTEON (FUN_0040210c). Query/refire run BEFORE\nthe cb4 advance each release frame; the handler never writes\nlocoState on release (the event system owns the next state via\ncbc=0). rt.animChuteLoop models the live instance node (seam\nstate, not a Kurt field, not saved).\n\nanimFootAlt (0x49b924) — classified TRANSIENT (C): a .data global\nbeside the anim-table pointers, written/read only by\nFUN_00461954 to select the FOOT1/FOOT3 vs FOOT2/FOOT4 parity at\nthe run/runfir footstep crossings. The save DAMP record covers\n0x540bfc + 724B — 0x49b924 is far outside it, and sound-object\nstate is not in the save image. No save/load change; a stale\nvalue after load only flips sample parity (cosmetic).\n\nTests: +7 focused checks — sustain sets the latch, release-after-\nsustain fires query+refire once then query-only, release-without-\nsustain never refires, mantle enter clears the latch.\nmdk_tests 5415/0, CTest 1/1, pytest 19/0, LEVEL3-8 60f digests\nunchanged (goldens never reach 0x2bd), diag=0. Docs updated:\nGAMEPLAY_RECONSTRUCTION.md sections 200/203.\n\nTRAVERSAL KURT ANIMATION SEMANTICS: CLOSED FOR BUILD_A\n(unconditional).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7576fda0c87d12f9efce35725cfa26aecba59245","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/7576fda0c87d12f9efce35725cfa26aecba59245"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/f855a5ebc047362f2599d2582b60c8d984edf48f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commit/f855a5ebc047362f2599d2582b60c8d984edf48f","node_