ing the previous sniper-only stub.\n\nData source (OBSERVED on real BUILD_A data): Kurt is a 2D RLE\nsprite, not a CMI object. 29 name-bound tables wired by\nFUN_0046445c — 23 records from TRAVSPRT.BNI via payload+4\n(FUN_004039ec) plus 6 slide/surf records from the per-level\nLEVEL<n>S.SNI sprite-name bank via FUN_004289a0 (imageBase +\nrecord[+0x10] + 4, flag +0x0D&0x80 records). Record layout is the\n{count, ofs[N], 8-byte frames} format fti_sprite.h already\ndecodes; the per-level SNI is loaded beside the DTI\n(\"%s\\LEVEL%d\\LEVEL%ds.sni\").\n\nMachine (OBSERVED from the FUN_00461954 disasm): range-tree\ndispatch on locoState with the animPrev first-frame latch,\noverlay clear + shadow snapshot before dispatch, frame select +\nhandler side-effects (locoState/eventPriority/airCharge/\neyeHeight/pullback/invHudTimer/e44-e48/vertSkip writes), then the\nlatch reads the POST-handler state and the draw gate\n(hudActive && (!flag49b740 || (flagC9c && ca0>=2))) gates the\ndeferred blit. Quirks preserved: the K_RJMP +0x14 ofs shift\n(ofs[cb4+4]), FUN_00464308''s unclamped rint(cb8) standstill edge,\nvertVel-keyed jump thresholds, K_CHUTEC ping-pong, mantle\nhalf-rate root-motion nudge, surf-jump park/unpin, slip->slide\nchain, bang->bFlip tumble counter, 0x322 + the 0x2c0..0x31f and\n0x32b..0x383 unknown bands.\n\nNative core: src/core/player_animation.{h,cpp} — the binder, the\ntick (full dispatch), FUN_004375f4 crossing helper, and the\nframe-identity resolver for deterministic traces. Integrated at\nthe FUN_00436d60 draw-driver call site; the old sniper-only\nplayerAnimAdvance stub is removed. --traversal-runtime now prints\nst/af/at=TABLE[idx]/dr and folds the animation state into the\ndigest. Save/restore already covers the authoritative globals at\ntheir original addresses (cac/cb0/cb4/cb8/cbc/c90/c84/cc0/e44/e48);\nframe-pair outputs are per-frame transient, matching the\noriginal.\n\nFreefall boundary: SEPARATE pipeline (Phase 13A core owns its own\nglobals/records/draw path — FUN_00461954 never appears there).\nPhase 16A is traversal-only; Godot Kurt presentation stays\ndeferred.\n\nValidation: focused synthetic-table tests cover every dispatched\nstate incl. binding, crossing shapes, quirks, gates, muzzle\nparity (5408/0, +189). LEVEL3-8 60f: all PASS, diag=0, script\ninsn unchanged (1791/128/1915/1771/458/2828); traces show\nK_IDLE->K_RUN speed-phase->K_JUMP vertVel-park correctly.\nRebaselined 60f digests (fold now carries animation state):\nL3 cdb1ea884dc0876d, L4 f3c517ed777e87e6, L5 50259d6fd931bf5e,\nL6 58a2587aabe57d91, L7 37eb67e2b5cf3e8d, L8 0a8aa8bfde3ed2cd.\nCTest 1/1, pytest 19/0.\n\nTRAVERSAL KURT ANIMATION SEMANTICS: CLOSED FOR BUILD_A.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cdfeafc7e0ef8d97dfb0eec513e5490797104f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/3cdfeafc7e0ef8d97dfb0eec513e5490797104f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/7402900830bb1f624a3ea7d82f0450ef9cfe03f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18028674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kuh9325","id":18028674,"login":"kuh9325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDI4Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}"