ail":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 15C (VM-RE): close GUNT_10 residual gate opcodes\n\nEvidence closure for the three §191 residual object-VM sites —\n0xf2@+21e65 (XBN), 0x60@+21f0c (XGUNTAM), 0x55@+2201d (XBO).\n\nAll three dispatch slots verified (u32[253] @ 0x438a5c:\n0xf2->0x451987, 0x60->0x444bb0, 0x55->0x449524) and all three\nhandlers disassembled — the port''s implementations match\nbyte-for-byte. Live reachability proven on the never-saved GUNT_10\npath and the save->restore golden; all three classify as executed +\nalready covered (B). No new handler semantics required.\n\nIncidental fidelity fix surfaced by the 0x444bb0 linkage-tail\ncomparison: the shared tail clears mark[depth+1] on call and\nmark[depth] on goto — the object side was already faithful; the\narena side cleared marker[depth] on call, never on goto, and\nmarker[] was [4] while mark[4] (+0x274) is reachable at max depth.\nFixed to the observed semantics (marker[5], post-increment clear on\ncall, current-depth clear on goto; AREN serialization unchanged).\nNo observable delta on real paths; zero digest drift L3-L8.\n\nValidation: GUNT_10 diag=0; save->restore golden endLevel=1\nunchanged; never-saved stale-leader deadlock preserved; L3-8 60f\ndigests unchanged; mdk_tests 5219/0; CTest 1/1; pytest 19/0;\nselftests 4/4; campaign handoff 5/5; sequence 23c84c9f241af58b;\narena-render 60/60; frontend 60/0; BUILD_A 141/141.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"13f0e570532555fe586eda9a18957d83f64d4f66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/13f0e570532555fe586eda9a18957d83f64d4f66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/commits/88bb60119525bfc4f4419aba9170749d50d087d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://av