pi.github.com/users/kuh9325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kuh9325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/commits/bbde93a07fa980d3341f640cd19e3676b2281898/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:33:58Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:33:58Z","email":"kuh9325@naver.com","name":"Junho Kim"},"message":"Phase 15A: GUNT_10 golden via save->restore->continue; endLevel=1\n\n- Mid-fight checkpoint: XBSHIP dead (T1-T7 element kills), flag(1,1)\n  set, six XG walkers spawned -> 38795B full save (levelId=4).\n- Restore + XG:2 sweep: six deaths -> watcher -> door sub ->\n  flag(1,2) -> +217ca broadcast FIRES -> XGUNTAM-2 -> +21f88 ->\n  83 00 @0x21ff7 -> endLevel=1 (~f320 post-restore).\n- Never-saved control (900f, same hits): X10_DOOR parked at +217bf,\n  outrank filter skips the broadcast permanently — the stale-leader\n  deadlock is confirmed authentic retail-modeled behavior.\n- Save-writer fidelity (evidence, no semantic change): torn-down\n  object refs emit 0 + warn (FUN_0045cf90 memsets +0x7c -> the\n  original emits 0 verbatim); +0x110 joins the anim-record fields\n  on the -1+warn path (X10_DOOR +0x110==2 observed). The leader-ref\n  degrade is byte-faithful — the original''s own save/load clears the\n  stale leader identically, which is what unblocked the door gate.\n- mdk_tests 5195/0, ctest pass, pytest 19/0 (MDK_GODOT_BIN).\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ceed7713bb8463642eb47e93ddb112907f2c3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuh9325/MDK_Transplant/git/trees/9ceed7713bb8463642eb47e93ddb112907f2c3a6"},"url":"https://a