-page bilíngue (PT/EN) para Thiago Madeira\n\nPortfolio frontend-first (Angular • React/Next.js) com detecção automática\nde idioma + toggle persistido, dark minimal com acento, timeline híbrida\nconsistente com o LinkedIn (NTT DATA → Avangrid/Cubo Itaú, Brasa,\nPromotora Presença, UNASP), depoimentos reais do LinkedIn, contatos\ncompletos, SEO/Open Graph e deploy automático no GitHub Pages.\n\nConteúdo mapeado do dossiê, do site antigo (thiago-madeira.web.app) e do\nperfil do LinkedIn. Backend aparece apenas como contexto histórico.\nPendências (projetos reais, PDFs de currículo, foto) documentadas no README.","tree":{"sha":"0c4a3010e17c826a8f2e18a630cbe865f91647b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thimadera/thimadera.github.io/git/trees/0c4a3010e17c826a8f2e18a630cbe865f91647b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thimadera/thimadera.github.io/git/commits/61429f1fc3746eaa84933fcd97ac5344d4774bcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48682091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thimadera","id":48682091,"login":"thimadera","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NjgyMDkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thimadera","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g