gents/socket.io (AgentToken\n  auth via handshake auth/query) + AgentHub registry with synchronous\n  ack-based Execute (10s actions / 20s logs; 503/504/502 mapping)\n- CommandService branches local (in-process Docker/PM2) vs remote\n  (hub) by serverId; server_control handler + routes under /servers\n- Agent command DTOs (AgentCommand/AgentCommandResult/LogsData)\n\nAgents:\n- Go: control.go Socket.IO client executing docker/pm2 commands with\n  ack, docker log demux, PM2 axon-rpc start/stop/restart + log tail\n- Python: control.py same protocol (optional python-socketio dep)\n\nFrontend:\n- system store actions take optional serverId (remote paths + 15s/25s\n  timeouts); Docker/PM2 item components thread serverId through\n- Error mapping for 503 (agent offline) and 504 (agent timeout)\n- nginx proxies /api/v1/agents/socket.io/ with Upgrade headers","tree":{"sha":"291232a64596115c61ac45f2c3054fe467b9dd48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ali-mdv/ServerPulse/git/trees/291232a64596115c61ac45f2c3054fe467b9dd48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ali-mdv/ServerPulse/git/commits/e7007092c1e173d7d666b43ac9ba6caca3974741","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ali-mdv/ServerPulse/commit/e7007092c1e173d7d666b43ac9ba6caca3974741","node_id":"C_kwDOUd2shtoAKGU3MDA3MDkyYzFlMTczZDdkNjY2YjQzYWM5YmE2Y2FjYTM5NzQ3NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ali-mdv/ServerPulse/commit/c52785aaa127a539ab3dbf3827f3556ad12a3b40","sha":"c52785aaa127a539ab3dbf3827f3556ad12a3b40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ali-mdv/ServerPulse/commits/c52785aaa127a539ab3dbf3827f3556ad12a3b40"}],"sha":"e7007092c1e173d7d666b43ac9ba6caca3974741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ali-mdv/ServerPulse/commits/e7007092c1e173d7d666b43ac9ba6caca3974741"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ali-mdv/ServerPulse/commits/c52785aaa127a539ab3dbf3827f3556ad12a3b40/co