rs/karencaicedo1907/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karencaicedo1907","id":179605579,"login":"karencaicedo1907","node_id":"U_kgDOCrSQSw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/commits/3fc38b89ab7009f77ac22da7d033c953443846ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:52:15Z","email":"kjcaicedo-2023a@corhuila.edu.co","name":"Karen Caicedo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:52:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(catalog): merge PR #28 - fix movie detail links for shell mount\n\n## Summary\nFixed movie detail navigation links to work correctly when the Catalog portal is mounted under `/movies` by the shell. The shell mounts the Catalog portal at `/movies`, so absolute links like `/movies/:movieId` were resolving to `/movies/movies/:movieId` causing 404 errors.\n\n## Changes\n- **F1 — Fix movie detail links**: Changed absolute routes `/movies/:movieId` to relative `[''movies'', movie.id]` in `billboard-page.component.ts` (poster, title, \"Ver película\" button) so links resolve correctly under shell mount at `/movies`.\n- **F2 — Fix back link in movie detail**: Changed `routerLink=\"/\"` to `routerLink=\"../\"` in `movie-detail-page.component.ts` so \"Volver a la cartelera\" navigates to billboard instead of shell home.\n- **Refactor**: Extracted duplicated route array `[''movies'', movie.id]` to `getMovieRoute(movie)` helper method in `BillboardPageComponent` (3 usages consolidated).\n- **Showtime links**: Already correct — point to `/booking/showtime/:showtimeId` (Booking portal owns seat map & holds).\n- **No service/dataset changes** — Uses existing `rating` field and routing from PR #23/#27.\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 40/40 ✅\n- `npm run build` → AOT ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n- `git diff --check` → clean\n\n## UX/UI Traceability\n- HU-UI-001: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/design-system.md\n- HU-UI-002: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/wireframes.md\n- Navigation Map: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/navigation-map.md\n- Live mockup: https://karencaicedo1907.github.io/cinesync-mockup/\n\n## Bot Review\nApproved (non-blocking). Findings recorded for checkpoint defense:\n- #1 Routing assumption documented (Cut 2 scope)\n- #2 Regression test deferred (follow-up)\n- #3 Checklist fixed\n- #4 Trailing newline added\n- #5 Performance acceptable for Cut 2\n\nCloses #26\nRefs: #6","tree":{"sha":"33d5d07e53dd49c1a85eb297f8cf21835baac253","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/trees/33d5d07e53dd49c1a85eb297f8cf21835baac253"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/commits/3fc38b89ab7009f77ac22da7d033c953443846ff","verification":{"payload":"tree 33d5d07e53dd49c1a85eb297f8cf21835baac253\nparent 5d1898ca8403982e3e0f6a4e0be886fbf607a903\nparent 57ea376a97147c1e3e995c48f44385c69e9e931a\nauthor Karen Caicedo <kjcaicedo-2023a@corhuila.edu.co> 1791435135 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791435135 -0500\n\nfix(catalog): merge PR #28 - fix movie detail links for shell mount\n\n## Summary\nFixed movie detail navigation links to work correctly when the Catalog portal is mounted under `/movies` by the shell. The shell mounts the Catalog portal at `/movies`, so absolute links like `/movies/:movieId` were resolving to `/movies/movies/:movieId` causing 404 errors.\n\n## Changes\n- **F1 — Fix movie detail links**: Changed absolute routes `/movies/:movieId` to relative `[''movies'', movie.id]` in `billboard-page.component.ts` (poster, title, \"Ver película\" button) so links resolve correctly under shell mount at `/movies`.\n- **F2 — Fix back link in movie detail**: Changed `routerLink=\"/\"` to `routerLink=\"../\"` in `movie-detail-page.component.ts` so \"Volver a la cartelera\" navigates to billboard instead of shell home.\n- **Refactor**: Extracted duplicated route array `[''movies'', movie.id]` to `getMovieRoute(movie)` helper method in `BillboardPageComponent` (3 usages consolidated).\n- **Showtime links**: Already correct — point to `/booking/showtime/:showtimeId` (Booking portal owns seat map & holds).\n- **No service/dataset changes** — Uses existing `rating` field and routing from PR #23/#27.\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 40/40 ✅\n- `npm run build` → AOT ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n- `git diff --check` → clean\n\n## UX/UI Traceability\n- HU-UI-001: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/design-system.md\n- HU-UI-002: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/wireframes.md\n- Navigation Map: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/navigation-map.md\n- Live mockup: https://karencaicedo1907.github.io/cinesync-mockup/\n\n## Bot Review\nApproved (non-blocking). Findings recorded for checkpoint defense:\n- #1 Routing assumption documented (Cut 2 scope)\n- #2 Regression test deferred (follow-up)\n- #3 Checklist fixed\n- #4 Trailing newline added\n- #5 Performance acceptable for Cut 2\n\nCloses #26\nRefs: #6","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxyF/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAD/UQADyblHKixS5S8tLfEo7AmBHj\ndkH+Pu3ld7rkuWITymIsaSaiJlw0JviuIfomDcUPjWw/d2agw36QJOdu1tni+x1y\nUnHYhDJ7Yyukmne4iyItmHtVYQ5QqLg/TyEnKbfqMFH08/EAa8nYBP+6RZcKHIFI\n+ivM7T2VT+vpyA