)\n- **F3** Stripped `min-height: 100vh` and page `background` from seat map `:host` and `.seat-shell`\n- **Links** Repointed showtime links in `billboard-page.component.ts` and `movie-detail-page.component.ts` from `/showtimes/:id/seats` to `/booking/showtime/:showtimeId` (Booking owns seat map & holds)\n- **UUIDs** Converted all synthetic showtime IDs to RFC 4122 UUID v4 (st-* → UUID v4)\n- **Styles** Removed dead CSS (`.site-header`, `.brand`, `.brand-mark`, `.brand-name`, `.nav-title`)\n- **Tests** 40 passing (3 seat map tests: 48 seats A1–F8, A1 occupied/disabled, DRAFT showtime hides seats)\n- **README** Documents 48 seats A1–F8, UUID v4 showtime IDs, Catalog→Booking integration, DRAFT protection\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 40/40 ✅\n- `npm run build` → AOT ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n- `git diff --check` → clean\n\n## UX/UI Traceability\n- HU-UI-001: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/design-system.md\n- HU-UI-002: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/wireframes.md\n- Navigation Map: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/navigation-map.md\n- Live mockup: https://karencaicedo1907.github.io/cinesync-mockup/\n\n## Bot Review\nApproved (non-blocking). Findings recorded for checkpoint defense:\n- #1 Hardcoded Booking links (accepted risk, Cut 2 scope)\n- #2 UUID contract only in README (deferred to Catalog API)\n- #3 PR title fixed to `refactor`\n- #4 README vs diff (data from PR #23)\n\nCloses #20\nRefs: #6","tree":{"sha":"b4d05a40d765dbe54680e16bf438ecda87c08d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/trees/b4d05a40d765dbe54680e16bf438ecda87c08d30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/commits/5d1898ca8403982e3e0f6a4e0be886fbf607a903","verification":{"payload":"tree b4d05a40d765dbe54680e16bf438ecda87c08d30\nparent e6b406f7289851ab0f78a30a33a08ce972eb2099\nparent 0a57e45a55eb84e3dccb876ce14502ba7ab9b5bb\nauthor Karen Caicedo <kjcaicedo-2023a@corhuila.edu.co> 1791390271 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791390271 -0500\n\nrefactor(catalog): merge PR #27 - seat map cleanup & booking links\n\n## Summary\nAdjusted the seat map page for correct shell integration and wired showtime links to the Booking portal. Implements HU-FE-CATALOG-001 (Cut 2 synthetic data) with UX/UI compliance per HU-UI-001/002.\n\n## Changes\n- **F1** Removed duplicate `<nav class=\"site-header\">` from `seat-map-page.component.ts` (shell owns header at `/`)\n- **F3** Stripped `min-height: 100vh` and page `background` from seat map `:host` and `.seat-shell`\n- **Links** Repointed showtime links in `billboard-page.component.ts` and `movie-detail-page.component.ts` from `/showtimes/:id/seats` to `/booking/showtime/:showtimeId` (Booking owns seat map & holds)\n- **UUIDs** Converted all synthetic showtime IDs to RFC 4122 UUID v4 (st-* → UUID v4)\n- **Styles** Removed dead CSS (`.site-header`, `.brand`, `.brand-mark`, `.brand-name`, `.nav-title`)\n- **Tests** 40 passing (3 seat map tests: 48 seats A1–F8, A1 occupied/disabled, DRAFT showtime hides seats)\n- **README** Documents 48 seats A1–F8, UUID v4 showtime IDs, Catalog→Booking integration, DRAFT protection\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 40/40 ✅\n- `npm run build` → AOT ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n- `git diff --check` → clean\n\n## UX/UI Traceability\n- HU-UI-001: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/design-system.md\n- HU-UI-002: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/wireframes.md\n- Navigation Map: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/navigation-map.md\n- Live mockup: https://karencaicedo1907.github.io/cinesync-mockup/\n\n## Bot Review\nApproved (non-blocking). Findings recorded for checkpoint defense:\n- #1 Hardcoded Booking links (accepted risk, Cut 2 scope)\n- #2 UUID contract only in README (deferred to Catalog API)\n- #3 PR title fixed to `refactor`\n- #4 README vs diff (data from PR #23)\n\nCloses #20\nRefs: #6","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxnI/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuxsQAGVv+aH6we4Ed66yhMcIL5mA\nKCHVTv3kwBLoHY3G3wijgIMVSHILmillS2ICtkDnI6rJxIR0lnPhZCHamDEv1WvW\ne+d7FAYPao8Hntrnm0DoSAcfDw6J9zVUiZfLKbMyxhNd9jmscXbsxdqbLqrPCRc/\nkbrseHzFWEwPup1zf3V8+I1ZM7+TfiyuxXhC9gfzsApEE2N9yzwz/ozHIeAH3hey\nsZrKhL6NY3jGgGmJ/gDNskWdMtk5EGOiZUko3fEsYlbRcUkDHMVNrV3+mnXSSWhx\nJ1c/j11DbnFLHUabIYBIViD3FwgDPK/TYf8RgXjI6BYO387oEPHXlGaE5h/8uoVP\nQ25J5ZQGuYJbwkur3GnGyp9S2VzxqMzdcUWKUX3Q34AhlGtt1HLVs90aJlsdT9xa\nPFhbxZxfaxFdKKSRqI9Nz8o2AGVIibAxdjdVkE00q+WgBKll5C5U4aHSa6skbB28\nnDcTX798GrXXj4TxRDIwCfEqwrKGxC7AJaxt2g0A/tIIWpxo+zvd9bRQgKwjf8tg\no1qVG4O6GosOYZQu/VaMsxZX2YNlzdVeDsfrgMGeRJ2waR1X/oFJk1NvH8oeaqOv\nOPJ2up0Rn7jrSsCwTcPgJWa3B+repmS3zUI9y16XCCo/vsWaWVk2Bq4OP9Wdc7K3\n6ShFmK1bBSZmGbzfSba2\n=uM1s\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T16:24:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/commit/5d1898ca8403982e3e0f6a4e0be886fbf607a903","no