lements HU-FE-CATALOG-001 (Cut 2 synthetic data) with UX/UI compliance per HU-UI-001/002.\n\n## Changes\n- **F2** Removed duplicate `<nav class=\"site-header\">` from `movie-detail-page.component.ts` (shell owns header at `/`)\n- **F3** Stripped `min-height: 100vh` and page `background` from detail `:host` and `.detail-shell`\n- **F4** Added dynamic rating from `movie.rating` via `rating != null` conditional (allows 0, hides undefined)\n- **Styles** Removed dead CSS (`.site-header`, `.brand`, `.brand-mark`, `.brand-name`, `.nav-title`)\n- **Tests** +3 new: rating shown, rating hidden when undefined, no header/brand in DOM\n- **No service/dataset changes** — uses `rating` field from PR #23\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 40/40 ✅\n- `npm run build` → AOT ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n- `git diff --check` → clean\n\n## UX/UI Traceability\n- HU-UI-001: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/design-system.md\n- HU-UI-002: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/wireframes.md\n- Navigation Map: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/navigation-map.md\n- Live mockup: https://karencaicedo1907.github.io/cinesync-mockup/\n\n## Bot Review\nApproved (non-blocking). Findings recorded for checkpoint defense:\n- #1 Shell contract (accepted risk, documented)\n- #2 PR title fixed to `fix(catalog): ...`\n- #3 Description fixed to show `rating != null`\n- #4 Test coupling to CSS classes (accepted)\n\nCloses #19\nRefs: #6","tree":{"sha":"4b457a4297ae8a2ee956700517a186216a151945","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/trees/4b457a4297ae8a2ee956700517a186216a151945"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/commits/e6b406f7289851ab0f78a30a33a08ce972eb2099","verification":{"payload":"tree 4b457a4297ae8a2ee956700517a186216a151945\nparent a93aaff9d6b55dcf682c42fc0a24d565acec78c1\nparent 83f905f57cda90f236088fa54f3185e59c8358b8\nauthor Karen Caicedo <kjcaicedo-2023a@corhuila.edu.co> 1791353051 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791353051 -0500\n\nfix(catalog): merge PR #25 - remove duplicate header and add dynamic rating to movie detail\n\n## Summary\nAdjusted the movie detail page for correct shell integration and dynamic ratings. Implements HU-FE-CATALOG-001 (Cut 2 synthetic data) with UX/UI compliance per HU-UI-001/002.\n\n## Changes\n- **F2** Removed duplicate `<nav class=\"site-header\">` from `movie-detail-page.component.ts` (shell owns header at `/`)\n- **F3** Stripped `min-height: 100vh` and page `background` from detail `:host` and `.detail-shell`\n- **F4** Added dynamic rating from `movie.rating` via `rating != null` conditional (allows 0, hides undefined)\n- **Styles** Removed dead CSS (`.site-header`, `.brand`, `.brand-mark`, `.brand-name`, `.nav-title`)\n- **Tests** +3 new: rating shown, rating hidden when undefined, no header/brand in DOM\n- **No service/dataset changes** — uses `rating` field from PR #23\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 40/40 ✅\n- `npm run build` → AOT ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n- `git diff --check` → clean\n\n## UX/UI Traceability\n- HU-UI-001: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/design-system.md\n- HU-UI-002: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/wireframes.md\n- Navigation Map: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/navigation-map.md\n- Live mockup: https://karencaicedo1907.github.io/cinesync-mockup/\n\n## Bot Review\nApproved (non-blocking). Findings recorded for checkpoint defense:\n- #1 Shell contract (accepted risk, documented)\n- #2 PR title fixed to `fix(catalog): ...`\n- #3 Description fixed to show `rating != null`\n- #4 Test coupling to CSS classes (accepted)\n\nCloses #19\nRefs: #6","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxeDbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/XoQAANVZj8cpwQkLnZ6HiLcG5mm\nO+BTt8bkcxef+SLvP3PsRORDtwSYNdw2hvMk9BcI+7HvPLtt6I5e/BrFCQti6RLJ\nQjmnEdgoUkCpEv/veGgd3N5n9mxQ7oRF