ing from movie.rating (hides when undefined)\n- Specs: rating conditional tests, no header/brand in DOM\n\nCloses #19\nRefs: #6","tree":{"sha":"b878e25f8b6ad8478fa94c37c7eedf39b7fd617c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/trees/b878e25f8b6ad8478fa94c37c7eedf39b7fd617c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/commits/b8692d403e425f12166ddd6c5c002e7336aef824","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179605579?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karencaicedo1907","id":179605579,"login":"karencaicedo1907","node_id":"U_kgDOCrSQSw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/commit/b8692d403e425f12166ddd6c5c002e7336aef824","node_id":"C_kwDOUeFqSdoAKGI4NjkyZDQwM2U0MjVmMTIxNjZkZGQ2YzVjMDAyZTczMzZhZWY4MjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/commit/a93aaff9d6b55dcf682c42fc0a24d565acec78c1","sha":"a93aaff9d6b55dcf682c42fc0a24d565acec78c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/commits/a93aaff9d6b55dcf682c42fc0a24d565acec78c1"}],"sha":"b8692d403e425f12166ddd6c5c002e7336aef824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/commits/b8692d403e425f12166ddd6c5c002e7336aef824"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179605579?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karencaicedo1907","id":179605579,"login":"karencaicedo1907","node_id":"U_kgDOCrSQSw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karencaicedo1907","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/commits/a93aaff9d6b55dcf682c42fc0a24d565acec78c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:42:54Z","email":"kjcaicedo-2023a@corhuila.edu.co","name":"Karen Caicedo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:42:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(catalog): merge PR #23 - build billboard interface and branding\n\n## Summary\nAdjusted the billboard page so it renders correctly when the shell mounts the Catalog portal at `/`. Implements HU-FE-CATALOG-001 (Cut 2 synthetic data) with UX/UI compliance per HU-UI-001/002.\n\n## Changes\n- **F1** Removed duplicate `<header>` from `billboard-page.component.ts` (shell owns header at `/`)\n- **F2** Added standalone-only brand/logo header to `AppComponent` (dev fallback)\n- **F3** Stripped `min-height: 100vh` and page `background` from billboard `:host`\n- **F4** Added optional `rating?: number` to `Movie`/`SyntheticMovie`/`MovieExtended`; populated mockup ratings (Interstellar 9.2, Dark Knight 9.0, Oppenheimer 8.9, Avatar 8.5); conditional badge rendering\n- **F5** Added `/movies` → `/` redirect in `catalog.routes.ts`\n- **Auth** Removed `Iniciar sesión`/`Registrarse` from billboard (shell handles auth); standalone shows brand only\n- **Critical fix** Added `RouterLink` import to `AppComponent` for AOT compilation\n- **Styles** All scoped via `:host` + component classes — no global leakage\n- **Tests** 37 passing (10 new billboard/AppComponent tests)\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 37/37 ✅\n- `npm run build` → AOT ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n- `git diff --check` → clean (CRLF only)\n\n## UX/UI Traceability\n- HU-UI-001: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/design-system.md\n- HU-UI-002: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/wireframes.md\n- Navigation Map: https://github.com/code-corhuila/csp-docs/blob/main/12-ux-ui/navigation-map.md\n- Live mockup: https://karencaicedo1907.github.io/cinesync-mockup/\n\n## Bot Review\nApproved (non-blocking). Findings recorded for checkpoint defense:\n- #1 Branding duplication in standalone fallback (accepted)\n- #2 Truthy rating check (mock data 8.5–9.2, 0 not realistic)\n- #3 Rating contract deferred to Catalog API\n- #4 Traceability section fixed in PR description\n- #5 `/movies` redirect test optional\n\nCloses #18\nRefs: #6","tree":{"sha":"d9cecc55a1550bf085d3e8e46f580b32984a9c23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/trees/d9cecc55a1550bf085d3e8e46f580b32984a9c23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/commits/a93aaff9d6b55dcf682c42fc0a24d565acec78c1","verification":{"