). Findings recorded for checkpoint defense:\n- #1 Branding duplication in standalone fallback (accepted)\n- #2 Truthy rating check (mock data 8.5–9.2, 0 not realistic)\n- #3 Rating contract deferred to Catalog API\n- #4 Traceability section fixed in PR description\n- #5 `/movies` redirect test optional\n\nCloses #18\nRefs: #6","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxc3OCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdAEQAHgATRbJHHGk0drzqgBnVQ9z\nCpy8HDtJxwLkjnrz/UdHJWz+ChLjAHg8QOeRXxoGJ94jOYg3LZNv4k0wJy8vDSop\nwlsQ7Jicea3qOw84UMN9a9vXq4lyCcQRohqtGLq4tiziubNXCTUSu8epDEw+jNDl\nzYGrS8eHhMjnS4j01giQOTnwcCTMMbWNiJzFQAQYCQg95+LPHxKouc2paUxNl1mE\nKtUv9xh1cWdPapowQn0r82Y80lSgNswhtoeAlF7NjmSAn4NT5aPY+leZ3ImtkuWk\n16NqTUcb22fjh3WhkPYiMr2082ZlTUJHNKAbGK0VDJ8YX2fs4nwXnLU0+vS8F5CC\nc38zwEwh9dk+rKCuKgNDigse9w6f+vtH0z46225yYkprmMS2NLZLxmh5u/5PhQU0\nvUQB3oIX4fB3VGVUAA6vZFCdVhCjc9pNtvOXNcgyTwuah8F8BLm4Apc46UfVrpUx\n42Gg0o7pfb+ot/LdsgnGxDbkSfry8n1V7JznuzhuzJ0vQaZr9fXL+wXtWCSFs7q8\nUTUUKBQ/lTNWwpTDIRZqDhHFnTqh5OI5mpitA3V1+v1go369fSjLS6VLXXF4cU2R\n6vzCn3put1NvN5dd8f3fUAHrl7moLWRaAo2tegOc8tVkMugAkNjmajcBsI4J7JC0\nTMTXVTVZkpkcGY+XUyZU\n=ztd/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T04:42:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starr