at/hu-fe-catalog-001-synthetic-rules\n\n## Summary\nExpanded unit test coverage for the synthetic catalog domain rules (Cut 2, HU-FE-CATALOG-001). Verifies `PUBLISHED`/`DRAFT` visibility contract across `SyntheticCatalogDataService` and all three catalog pages.\n\n## Changes\n- **Service tests** (+14): `getMovie`, `getShowtimes` (with/without args), `getRoom`, `getSeats` — published/draft/non-existent cases + cross-cutting rules\n- **Billboard page** (+1): showtimes render for published movies\n- **Movie detail page** (+2): published movie detail + showtime links to seat map\n- **Seat map page** (+2): available seats enabled, A1 occupied/disabled, draft showtime renders no seats\n- **Total tests**: 27 passing (was 9)\n\n## Bot review follow-up\n- ✅ Branch prefix fixed: `test/` → `feat/` (course standard)\n- ✅ UTF-8 BOM removed from 4 spec files\n- ✅ Seat-map test uses `aria-label` instead of array index\n- ⏭️ `DatePipe` formatting test kept as-is (tests catalog rule, not locale rendering)\n- ⏭️ Full diff verified locally\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 27/27 ✅\n- `npm run build` → ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n\nCloses #17\nRefs: #6","tree":{"sha":"f9adde374db1fe553802e2dae2ef4122c5047859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/trees/f9adde374db1fe553802e2dae2ef4122c5047859"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/csp-catalog-portal/git/commits/b98114a495239c460283595a1c5f43b7d7775af0","verification":{"payload":"tree f9adde374db1fe553802e2dae2ef4122c5047859\nparent 14021687895519d4ea141e73f9e228987b6c6e94\nparent a5056851464badcde72cb8d6bbb2a2c48c9b49a3\nauthor Karen Caicedo <kjcaicedo-2023a@corhuila.edu.co> 1791338709 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791338709 -0500\n\ntest(catalog): merge PR #2 - cover expanded synthetic catalog rules\n\nMerge pull request #2 from feat/hu-fe-catalog-001-synthetic-rules\n\n## Summary\nExpanded unit test coverage for the synthetic catalog domain rules (Cut 2, HU-FE-CATALOG-001). Verifies `PUBLISHED`/`DRAFT` visibility contract across `SyntheticCatalogDataService` and all three catalog pages.\n\n## Changes\n- **Service tests** (+14): `getMovie`, `getShowtimes` (with/without args), `getRoom`, `getSeats` — published/draft/non-existent cases + cross-cutting rules\n- **Billboard page** (+1): showtimes render for published movies\n- **Movie detail page** (+2): published movie detail + showtime links to seat map\n- **Seat map page** (+2): available seats enabled, A1 occupied/disabled, draft showtime renders no seats\n- **Total tests**: 27 passing (was 9)\n\n## Bot review follow-up\n- ✅ Branch prefix fixed: `test/` → `feat/` (course standard)\n- ✅ UTF-8 BOM removed from 4 spec files\n- ✅ Seat-map test uses `aria-label` instead of array index\n- ⏭️ `DatePipe` formatting test kept as-is (tests catalog rule, not locale rendering)\n- ⏭️ Full diff verified locally\n\n## Validation\n- `npm test` → 27/27 ✅\n- `npm run build` → ✅\n- `npm run lint` → ✅\n\nCloses #17\nRefs: #6","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxajVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAa/YQAE1OWCZbgeDeBsSOb4ZntLPD\nsQbhzJxxoGA0hVleG0WE6aD8gwsiBZS8bKRLggxhP7bcbjWvuF+bKWxyjvVOXF2f\niIS35aD3uaCGGndXPS4us2rgaQbgvguBjrN+uhuSTSd+sifQlfU/xC5u1HoDRKI6\nrudEyK2VjXOt9nKysKkC2qqKLITUA6PvNuLYfHIsd1m3EHpH0dnR4/9jzSqm1px1\ntVX+vqDjVAohJLLqKl6EIILb9DOTs3jjKlsT3y6YO+Dzzzn5TUDMk1xQoSaAg1In\nLcjjW1wQLLCcuo/2K9B9nq9WisQ0MB66L+gkslLIvKkQVibh26aV1JyCo5HWpwHy\nlBuYj6Ha+pWcN56QCR7xlnL0FTyD6W/rjiEDHxzKYcE3X+66ukvVIeszapVr3aV7\nqJMCUtGPB4ezE62ACymSYvqbN2SZ1GpZKEDciS9ZSA2hL6mqFBAELZFdWvPFZenE\nrQ8NC+hzmBl0K87Ogmzo6ODwtyL9oEPfv7INJU2MmqY3gTrBWdLmu/jYLuZ9rbZb\n4xIZ6tA2WN46Te8YRQIpT0tqQTtqTSK00G4DG/WPbEyLsQdqBwFFhFBAJp48aTzB\ncTcDKS8zdJ44YiGL9S+KSTF9kgKWD1BfNyGwGbDhffXhE3Hf1yjG/6JX4FMchgYC\nL5v3gw4irHe6WDq7k8ss\n=JLam\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T02:05:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"