xample.com","name":"frontend-primitives"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T02:01:28Z","email":"noreply@example.com","name":"frontend-primitives"},"message":"Add ARCHITECTURE.md: design rationale across the whole monorepo\n\nCovers the problem class, the structural-guarantee thesis, the ScopeManager<T>\ncomposition pattern, scope-context''s five-axis design, cross-cutting principles\n(fail-closed vs fail-open, one primitive over a family of them), the build-vs-buy\nresearch (including the adversarial NestJS/Angular/Orleans/OTP comparison and its\nthree recorded-but-not-implemented candidate improvements), and what was\ndeliberately left out (hard realm isolation, CRDTs, a merged adapters package).","tree":{"sha":"b45aea7f371214579d52ab7c179e944d1203c95e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/git/trees/b45aea7f371214579d52ab7c179e944d1203c95e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/git/commits/8bbd477bfe36dd154f48d150d8f984dcdf3b50e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11974189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PyGuy2","id":11974189,"login":"PyGuy2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTc0MTg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github