t: a structural scope-bound bundle of storage/cache/request/comms/theme\n\nNew packages:\n- scope-context (core): zero-dep default adapters, createScopeContext() factory. The request\n  adapter is constructed with a direct reference to its own scope''s cache object, so cross-scope\n  cache writes are impossible by construction rather than by convention.\n- scope-context-tanstack-query: one QueryClient per scope\n- scope-context-dexie: one IndexedDB database per scope, wired per the persistent-storage recipe\n- scope-context-penpal: fail-closed comms with sender attribution, plus a bridge for any\n  two-way RPC transport (not literally coupled to the penpal npm package)\n- scope-context-react / scope-context-vue: <ScopeProvider>/provideScope() + useScope() and\n  per-axis hooks, framework packages that know nothing about the specific adapters used\n\n109 tests across 22 files, full typecheck/build green. Cross-linked from the four existing\nrecipes; .changeset linked-versioning extended to the six new packages.","tree":{"sha":"3040ea0bd0a96463d29d45047437d6bb9308eb4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/git/trees/3040ea0bd0a96463d29d45047437d6bb9308eb4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/git/commits/7c814e26f50c71accbd76fb41168a5d7847e0dd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11974189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PyGuy2","id":11974189,"login":"PyGuy2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTc0MTg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commit/7c814e26f50c71accbd76fb41168a5d7847e0dd4","node_id":"C_kwDOUeFwRNoAKDdjODE0ZTI2ZjUwYzcxYWNjYmQ3NmZiNDExNjhhNWQ3ODQ3ZTBkZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commit/c9f537b88cab735f92b3d4122db951ed04e6da88","sha":"c9f537b88cab735f92b3d4122db951ed04e6da88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commits/c9f537b88cab735f92b3d4122db951ed04e6da88"}],"sha":"7c814e26f50c71accbd76fb41168a5d7847e0dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commits/7c814e26f50c71accbd76fb41168a5d7847e0dd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11974189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PyGuy2","id":11974189,"login":"PyGuy2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTc0MTg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commits/c9f537b88cab735f92b3d4122db951ed04e6da88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T00:36:33Z","email":"noreply@example.com","name":"frontend-primitives"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T00:36:33Z","email":"noreply@example.com","name":"frontend-primitives"},"message":"Revert createWebLocksLock out of scope-manager\n\nIt has no real relationship to scope-manager''s actual theme (per-key\nlifecycle registry) — bundling it in was expedient, not architecturally\njustified. It stays a copy-pasteable recipe: small enough to read and\nverify at the call site, and not worth a package dependency to track.","tree":{"sha":"d5eff6b361253b8b459380387de9046cf286c672","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/git/trees/d5eff6b361253b8b459380387de9046cf286c672"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/git/commits/c9f537b88cab735f92b3d4122db951ed04e6da88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11974189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PyGuy2","id":11974189,"login":"PyGuy2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTc0MTg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commit/c9f537b88cab735f92b3d4122db951ed04e6da88","node_id":"C_kwDOUeFwRNoAKGM5ZjUzN2I4OGNhYjczNWY5MmIzZDQxMjJkYjk1MWVkMDRlNmRhODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commit/f746f9fe06d4a7c44a09ce66f28e7747bc588a8e","sha":"f746f9fe06d4a7c44a09ce66f28e7747bc588a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commits/f746f9fe06d4a7c44a09ce66f28e7747bc588a8e"}],"sha":"c9f537b88cab735f92b3d4122db951ed04e6da88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commits/c9f537b88cab735f92b3d4122db951ed04e6da88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11974189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PyGuy2","id":11974189,"login":"PyGuy2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTc0MTg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commits/f746f9fe06d4a7c44a09ce66f28e7747bc588a8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T00:01:52Z","email":"noreply@example.com","name":"frontend-primitives"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T00:01:52Z","email":"noreply@example.com","name":"frontend-primitives"},"message":"Add createWebLocksLock/createNoopLock to scope-manager\n\nPromoted the self-contained, race-free two-phase lock probe out of the\ncross-tab-coordination recipe into scope-manager as a fifth primitive —\nunlike the rest of that recipe (LockBridge, SharedChannel), it needs no\nproject-specific wiring, and browser-tabs-lock''s real mutex-breaking bug\nis concrete evidence for preferring the native Web Locks API here.","tree":{"sha":"934d24c6f58c5218d80775e6e6e6ece41c17406f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/git/trees/934d24c6f58c5218d80775e6e6e6ece41c17406f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/git/commits/f746f9fe06d4a7c44a09ce66f28e7747bc588a8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11974189?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PyGuy2","id":11974189,"login":"PyGuy2","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTc0MTg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PyGuy2","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commit/f746f9fe06d4a7c44a09ce66f28e7747bc588a8e","node_id":"C_kwDOUeFwRNoAKGY3NDZmOWZlMDZkNGE3YzQ0YTA5Y2U2NmYyOGU3NzQ3YmM1ODhhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/paul-leo/frontend-primitives/commit/be09510b26a7f6a9a4480c17f2b360b3d5073204","sha":"be09510b26a7f6a9a4480c17f2b360b3d5073204","url":"https://