ala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XimenaChala/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/XimenaChala","id":167532972,"login":"XimenaChala","node_id":"U_kgDOCfxZrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XimenaChala/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XimenaChala/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XimenaChala/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XimenaChala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/XimenaChala/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/XimenaChala","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/educk-front/commits/db81c961746605ac6149045addfcd2c99f7e9902/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:01:51Z","email":"167532972+XimenaChala@users.noreply.github.com","name":"XimenaChala"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:01:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(ci): remove scheduled cron from centinela workflow\n\n* chore(ci): remove scheduled cron from centinela workflow\n\nWhy: The 30-minute cron consumed 12,000+ minutes/month across 17 repos, exhausting the free GitHub Actions quota and disabling all workflows. The centinela now runs only on pull_request and workflow_dispatch, which is when it provides value. This restores functionality without paid minutes.\n\n* chore(ci): remove scheduled cron from centinela workflow\n\nWhy: The 30-minute cron consumed 12,000+ minutes/month across 17 repos, exhausting the free GitHub Actions quota and disabling all workflows. The centinela now runs only on pull_request and workflow_dispatch, which is when it provides value. This restores functionality without paid minutes.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ximena del Pilar Zambrano Chala <xdazmbrano-2022@corhuila.edu.co>","tree":{"sha":"90803c5e412784c027dfbc52d661837b77f3ebae