Z","email":"jdtovar-2021a@corhuila.edu.co","name":"Juan Diego Tovar Rodriguez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:45:48Z","email":"jdtovar-2021a@corhuila.edu.co","name":"Juan Diego Tovar Rodriguez"},"message":"feat(auth): split \"Mi cuenta\" into Perfil, Seguridad and Preferencias tabs\n\nHU-20: replaces the flat <dl> + password form with 3 tabs:\n- Perfil: username, name, email (HU-19) and role, with a large\n  initials avatar (same temporary fallback as the users table, same\n  TODO to switch to ui.Avatar). Loaded via api.me() so it reflects the\n  user''s current email/name instead of only the sign-in snapshot.\n- Seguridad: the existing password-change form, moved as-is - same\n  logic and validation, not touched.\n- Preferencias: a second way to switch the light/dark theme, reusing\n  the shell''s own mechanism (document.documentElement.dataset.theme +\n  the \"opti.theme\" localStorage key) instead of duplicating it. The\n  topbar toggle in opti-front''s Shell is left in place; removing it is\n  a separate, coordinated task.\n\nUses a plain button-group tab strip (.tabs/.tab-btn, added to the\nshared styles.css) rather than a component library.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"807f87f6a80c1d1fb3b0bfc34aef66fd3757709f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/opti-auth-portal/git/trees/807f87f6a80c1d1fb3b0bfc34aef66fd3757709f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/opti-auth-portal/git/commits/014c8a9384e1c781ddd689dbea3329448f613fa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203122056?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdtovar07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdtovar07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdtovar07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jdtova