ty becomes two dropdowns (Departamento then Ciudad, new\nmodel/colombia.ts) instead of free text - department is UI-only, only\nthe city name is sent, same field the service already had. Shared\nbetween PatientForm (new patient) and ContactForm (edit contact) via\na new EpsCityFields component, so both stay in sync.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92aa5ef65a4500789ccd9ad54639f52e59e9df0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/opti-customers-portal/git/trees/92aa5ef65a4500789ccd9ad54639f52e59e9df0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/opti-customers-portal/git/commits/b8ca1a713590640ebc1b10615b7aa70dddce21a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119374802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BackSua","id":119374802,"login":"BackSua","node_id":"U_kgDOBx2D0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/opti-customers-portal/commit/b8ca1a713590640ebc1b10615b7aa70dddce21a0","node_id":"C_kwDOUeHARtoAKGI4Y2ExYTcxMzU5MDY0MGViYzFiMTA2MTViN2FhNzBkZGRjZTIxYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/opti-customers-portal/com