brand\" filter added in HU-15: it was\naccepted in FrameQuery and read by FramesPage but never forwarded to\nthe request''s query string.\n\nKnown limitation (documented in productsApi.uploadImage): the shared\nApiClient from opti-front always JSON-stringifies the body and always\nsets Content-Type: application/json, with no FormData special case,\nso this upload needs a small follow-up there before it works\nend-to-end. Out of scope here since opti-front was off-limits for\nthis change; the backend endpoint itself is independently verified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d50a2978f3c887edc000cbc928610cb45c5ede45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/opti-products-portal/git/trees/d50a2978f3c887edc000cbc928610cb45c5ede45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/code-corhuila/opti-products-portal/git/commits/9050151b1f8f176706dc100463cd416b89a0665c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119374802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BackSua","id":119374802,"login":"BackSua","node_id":"U_kgDOBx2D0g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BackSua","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/code-corhuila/opti-pr