","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:43:15.514Z","repositoryId":1374928224,"sha":"c257565b5e249e30f56fd514b72b6ab2c225dbf1"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","providerType":"User"},"email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-17T18:52:13Z","committedDate":"2026-09-17T18:52:13Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:43:15.514Z","repositoryId":1374928224,"sha":"4293730d8ccb7422f7ba756d03b593fe3031b950"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:43:15.514Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/d1c9ad418cc68a586c2d854e3b9f6dd8f9e253d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:22:43Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:22:43Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"feat(observability): structured logging, metrics, Kafka DLT, and a Prometheus/Grafana/Loki stack\n\nPhase G: every backend service previously only wrote unstructured text to\nstdout, exposed no metrics beyond bare health checks, and had no alerting --\na bad Kafka message would retry forever with no signal. This closes that gap:\n\n- Structured JSON logs (logback-spring.xml + logstash-logback-encoder) across\n  four categories -- request, error, authentication, business event -- all\n  correlated by requestId/userId in MDC. userId is populated by a new\n  MdcUserIdFilter wired into each Security filter chain after JWT auth\n  resolves (not in the outer RequestIdFilter, which runs before Security and\n  can''t see the principal yet); RequestIdFilter''s single finally block clears\n  the MDC once per request to avoid leaking state across pooled threads.\n- Prometheus metrics via micrometer-registry-prometheus on all 7 services\n  (request rate/latency/errors, JVM, DB pool) plus custom business counters.\n- Bounded retry + per-consumer dead-letter topics for the 3 Kafka consumers\n  (fraud/audit/notification-service), which all read the same source topic\n  under different consumer groups -- a per-service DLT naming resolver keeps\n  their failures isolated instead of colliding in one shared DLT.\n- An opt-in docker-compose.observability.yml overlay (Prometheus, Grafana,\n  Loki, Promtail, Alertmanager) with a provisioned dashboard and 3 alert\n  rules (ServiceDown, HighErrorRate, KafkaConsumerFailure). Plain\n  `docker compose up` is unaffected.\n\nFixes a real regression caught by the auth-service test suite along the way:\nthe new catch-all exception handler was swallowing @PreAuthorize denials\nbefore they reached Spring Security''s ExceptionTranslationFilter, turning\n403s into 500s.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"259c9b8a81ddfd94f38bc2e8616860bfb4646c85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/259c9b8a81ddfd94f38bc2e8616860bfb4646c85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/d1c9ad418cc68a586c2d854e3b9f6dd8f9e253d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/d1c9ad418cc68a586c2d854e3b9f6dd8f9e253d9","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKGQxYzlhZDQxOGNjNjhhNTg2YzJkODU0ZTNiOWY2ZGQ4ZjllMjUzZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/2e47e42acf045a4c0cccbd76769ac84fb1f05cc3","sha":"2e47e42acf045a4c0cccbd76769ac84fb1f05cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/2e47e42acf045a4c0cccbd76769ac84fb1f05cc3"}],"sha":"d1c9ad418cc68a586c2d854e3b9f6dd8f9e253d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/d1c9ad418cc68a586c2d854e3b9f6dd8f9e253d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/2e47e42acf045a4c0cccbd76769ac84fb1f05cc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:28:28Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:28:28Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"fix(admin): CORS PATCH method and role-select initial value\n\nBoth found by actually clicking through the Admin page in a browser --\ncurl-based verification and unit tests missed them entirely:\n\n1. WebConfig.java''s CORS mapping allowed GET/POST/OPTIONS only. PATCH\n   (new for the user-management endpoints) failed CORS preflight with\n   403, so every role/status change silently failed in the real app\n   even though curl (which doesn''t enforce CORS) worked fine.\n\n2. app.html bound [value] directly on the <select>, which Angular sets\n   before the @for loop''s <option> children exist in the DOM -- the\n   browser falls back to the first option, so every row''s dropdown\n   displayed \"ADMIN\" regardless of that user''s actual role. Fixed by\n   moving the match to [selected] on each <option> instead, which is\n   applied at the correct time as each option renders.\n\nVerified live: role change and disable/enable now work end-to-end\nthrough the real UI, persist through a refresh, and a disabled\naccount is correctly rejected at login.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15765917387465f673f3f98987b5e70b3dad334b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/15765917387465f673f3f98987b5e70b3dad334b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/2e47e42acf045a4c0cccbd76769ac84fb1f05cc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/2e47e42acf045a4c0cccbd76769ac84fb1f05cc3","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKDJlNDdlNDJhY2YwNDVhNGMwY2NjYmQ3Njc2OWFjODRmYjFmMDVjYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/073eed77a970bfb1063c6d684f61c136c9b8bb5e","sha":"073eed77a970bfb1063c6d684f61c136c9b8bb5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/073eed77a970bfb1063c6d684f61c136c9b8bb5e"}],"sha":"2e47e42acf045a4c0cccbd76769ac84fb1f05cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/2e47e42acf045a4c0cccbd76769ac84fb1f05cc3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/073eed77a970bfb1063c6d684f61c136c9b8bb5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:19:45Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:19:45Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"ci(docker): wire auth-service into CI, containerize reports and admin\n\n- backend.yml: add auth-service to the test matrix (previously excluded\n  -- its new test suite would otherwise never run in CI).\n- docker.yml: smoke-test the new admin API (login as the seeded ADMIN\n  account, GET /api/auth/users) and all 6 frontend ports, not just the\n  shell''s.\n- docker-compose.yml: add reports (4204) and admin (4205) frontend\n  services, reusing infra/angular.Dockerfile exactly like the existing\n  4 apps -- ports already matched what apps/shell/public/env.js\n  expected. Verified live: both containers serve remoteEntry.json, each\n  env.js reflects only that app''s own vars, and the admin smoke test\n  passes against the running stack.\n- apps/reports, apps/admin: add the dev-default public/env.js every\n  other deployable app already has, and give reports its own\n  provideGraphQL(...) in app.config.ts for standalone `nx serve`\n  (matches payments/fraud/reconciliation''s convention -- admin doesn''t\n  need an equivalent since its only dependency, HttpClient, already\n  gets the CSRF-aware interceptor from the shell''s provideGraphQL()\n  once federated).\n- DEPLOYMENT.md: 6 Vercel projects instead of 4, drop the \"not\n  deployed yet\" caveats for Reports/Admin, remove the two now-resolved\n  items from the out-of-scope list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"92a6b45fd584046f84c50128df038a811a6534a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/92a6b45fd584046f84c50128df038a811a6534a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/073eed77a970bfb1063c6d684f61c136c9b8bb5e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/073eed77a970bfb1063c6d684f61c136c9b8bb5e","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKDA3M2VlZDc3YTk3MGJmYjEwNjNjNmQ2ODRmNjFjMTM2YzliOGJiNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/bb94b5e6105c0c7d5cc4e84170031490ed4c3764","sha":"bb94b5e6105c0c7d5cc4e84170031490ed4c3764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/bb94b5e6105c0c7d5cc4e84170031490ed4c3764"}],"sha":"073eed77a970bfb1063c6d684f61c136c9b8bb5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/073eed77a970bfb1063c6d684f61c136c9b8bb5e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/bb94b5e6105c0c7d5cc4e84170031490ed4c3764/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:09:57Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:09:57Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"test(payment,fraud,reconciliation): GraphQL authorization tests with minted JWTs\n\nEach service validates JWTs locally via its own JwtDecoder (no call to\nauth-service at runtime), so tests mint their own HS256 tokens in-test\n(TestJwtSupport, duplicated per service -- same convention as\nRolePermissions being hand-kept in sync across the module boundary)\nand exercise the real Spring Security filter chain via\nMockMvcWebTestClient + springSecurity().\n\nCovers: PAYMENT_ANALYST can create but not approve payments;\nOPERATIONS_MANAGER can approve; FRAUD_ANALYST cannot approve payments\nbut can investigate fraud cases (fraud-service); PAYMENT_ANALYST\ncannot investigate fraud cases; no auth cookie gets a raw HTTP 401 on\nall three GraphQL services.\n\nDiscovered while writing these: CsrfFilter runs before the\noauth2ResourceServer filter, so every request -- including the\ndeliberately-unauthenticated one -- needs a CSRF cookie/header pair or\nit fails CSRF (403) before authentication is ever evaluated. Documented\ninline since it''s not obvious from the security config alone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29adf5c5e0c0592786065d6e742f6fa036e18912","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/29adf5c5e0c0592786065d6e742f6fa036e18912"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/bb94b5e6105c0c7d5cc4e84170031490ed4c3764","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/bb94b5e6105c0c7d5cc4e84170031490ed4c3764","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKGJiOTRiNWU2MTA1YzBjN2Q1Y2M0ZTg0MTcwMDMxNDkwZWQ0YzM3NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/a468d4c336f6bdc58b2db87472576c5c2203feb2","sha":"a468d4c336f6bdc58b2db87472576c5c2203feb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/a468d4c336f6bdc58b2db87472576c5c2203feb2"}],"sha":"bb94b5e6105c0c7d5cc4e84170031490ed4c3764","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/bb94b5e6105c0c7d5cc4e84170031490ed4c3764"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/a468d4c336f6bdc58b2db87472576c5c2203feb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:01:48Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:01:48Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"test(auth-service): automated authentication, session, and admin RBAC tests\n\nauth-service had no src/test at all -- adds MockMvc integration tests\nagainst the real Spring context (same precondition as every other\nservice''s stub contextLoads test):\n\n- AuthenticationControllerTest: valid/wrong-password/unknown-email\n  login, disabled-account login (401, same generic error as a bad\n  password), and login -> /me -> logout -> /me session lifecycle.\n- UserAdminControllerTest: USER_VIEW/ROLE_MANAGE/USER_MANAGE each\n  independently required (403 without), role/status changes persist\n  through a follow-up GET, and the self-modification guard (400) on\n  both endpoints.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d5069bb24a65d5d737e371ed9d94d40e198003a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/3d5069bb24a65d5d737e371ed9d94d40e198003a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/a468d4c336f6bdc58b2db87472576c5c2203feb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/a468d4c336f6bdc58b2db87472576c5c2203feb2","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKGE0NjhkNGMzMzZmNmJkYzU4YjJkYjg3NDcyNTc2YzVjMjIwM2ZlYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/0d48b88c84ace6a913248f0a0dc03621781e1775","sha":"0d48b88c84ace6a913248f0a0dc03621781e1775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/0d48b88c84ace6a913248f0a0dc03621781e1775"}],"sha":"a468d4c336f6bdc58b2db87472576c5c2203feb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/a468d4c336f6bdc58b2db87472576c5c2203feb2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/0d48b88c84ace6a913248f0a0dc03621781e1775/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:57:52Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:57:52Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"feat(admin): build real user-management API and Admin page\n\nBackend (auth-service): AppUser gains an enabled column (with a DB-level\ndefault -- verified live against docker-compose Postgres, since a bare\nNOT NULL ADD COLUMN fails against DataSeeder''s existing rows). Adds\n@EnableMethodSecurity + a JwtAuthenticationConverter (mirroring payment-\nservice) so @PreAuthorize works, and a UserAdminController exposing\nGET/PATCH /api/auth/users gated by USER_VIEW/ROLE_MANAGE/USER_MANAGE.\nA self-modification guard (400) stops an admin locking themselves out.\nDisabled accounts are rejected at login with the same generic error as\na wrong password; already-issued JWTs remain valid until expiry (no\nrevocation added -- documented as a deliberate scope boundary).\n\nFrontend: replaces the Admin placeholder with a real user table --\nrole changes and enable/disable, each gated by the corresponding\npermission, with self-row actions disabled to match the backend guard.\n\nVerified end-to-end against the live docker-compose stack: RBAC denial\n(403), self-lockout (400), disabled-account login (401), and role/\nstatus changes persisting through a follow-up GET.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4c13829394247fc6cff62b65a936c822942ffca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/d4c13829394247fc6cff62b65a936c822942ffca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/0d48b88c84ace6a913248f0a0dc03621781e1775","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/0d48b88c84ace6a913248f0a0dc03621781e1775","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKDBkNDhiODhjODRhY2U2YTkxMzI0OGYwYTBkYzAzNjIxNzgxZTE3NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/364ef38c7d1c1144e59baa1f0a536409c2d8fdf6","sha":"364ef38c7d1c1144e59baa1f0a536409c2d8fdf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/364ef38c7d1c1144e59baa1f0a536409c2d8fdf6"}],"sha":"0d48b88c84ace6a913248f0a0dc03621781e1775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/0d48b88c84ace6a913248f0a0dc03621781e1775"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/364ef38c7d1c1144e59baa1f0a536409c2d8fdf6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:57:42Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:57:42Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"docs: Native Federation verification steps and production auth/RBAC test script\n\nPhase D follow-up: documents how to verify the 4-Vercel-project Native\nFederation layout in production, and adds a curl-based production\nauth/RBAC test script (login/cookie/refresh/logout, plus a direct-\nGraphQL Alice-creates/Bob-approves/Alice-403 demonstration). Also flags\nthat every backend DataSeeder runs unconditionally against an empty\nprod DB, seeding public demo credentials including an ADMIN account.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b498eb0f171124e17d27173999e503968b3e2a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platfo