124fb8e7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/abe9c58bddfff907dd0a1034d2fd3d9124fb8e7c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/2e955c9675f1fd03bacc9deb5c825510f0e9786f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:18:00Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:18:00Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"chore: add production deployment configuration\n\nMakes the app cloud-deployable (backend on Railway, frontend on Vercel)\nwithout changing application behavior:\n\n- Frontend: introduces a runtime env.js config mechanism (window.__env),\n  since none existed and every GraphQL/Auth/federation-remote URL was\n  compiled directly into the static JS bundle. The same built artifact now\n  works unmodified in dev, docker-compose, Railway, or Vercel -- only how\n  env.js gets generated differs (envsubst at container start for\n  Docker/Railway via infra/40-generate-env-js.sh, or scripts/generate-env-js.mjs\n  at build time for Vercel, which has no persistent container to hook into).\n- Backend: fixes 5 Dockerfiles'' mismatched EXPOSE ports, parameterizes the\n  remaining services'' DB credentials in docker-compose.yml, and makes\n  cookie Secure/SameSite configurable (was hardcoded \"Lax\") so the auth\n  cookie and CSRF cookie stay consistent across the domain topologies a\n  real deployment can end up with.\n- CORS was verified already correct (env-driven, credentialed, no\n  wildcard) -- no code change needed there.\n- DEPLOYMENT.md is the resulting runbook: platform decision, step-by-step\n  Railway + Vercel setup, the cookie-topology tradeoffs, and a production\n  readiness checklist. The actual deployment is a manual step for whoever\n  runs this -- creating accounts and deploying isn''t something this change\n  does on its own behalf.\n\nVerified via a full local docker-compose rebuild and browser regression\nacross all major flows and roles, plus an end-to-end dry run of the exact\nVercel build command against real-shaped env vars.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfbd232c37ba060517354e142c8ddcefd6dfe356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/bfbd232c37ba060517354e142c8ddcefd6dfe356"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/2e955c9675f1fd03bacc9deb5c825510f0e9786f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.