Xkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/b931da867914bf896a7df1b3f52a67bd402c7069/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:18:29Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T19:18:29Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"feat: Phase B UI/UX upgrade - design tokens, sidebar, KPI dashboard, table actions\n\nIntroduces a centralized design token system (libs/ui/src/styles/tokens.scss)\nformalizing the existing color/spacing/radius palette, migrates the shared\ncomponent library to use it, and reworks the shell''s presentation layer to\nlook like an operational enterprise product without touching business logic:\n\n- Sidebar navigation replaces the top header bar, preserving RBAC filtering\n  and logout behavior unchanged.\n- Dashboard now shows real KPIs (Payment Volume, Pending, Fraud Alerts) and\n  a Recent Payments table, computed client-side from existing GraphQL\n  queries and gated per-permission, with loading/error/empty states.\n- Shared Table component gains an opt-in, backward-compatible rowActions\n  slot; Payments/Fraud/Reconciliation lists get a consistent View action.\n\nNo routes, guards, services, or GraphQL schemas/generated code changed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2597189223d0497c0a1fcf139526975f3f48cbf7","url":"https://api.github.