chore: dockerize the full stack\n\ndocker-compose.yml now runs the whole system: Postgres (one instance,\none database per service via infra/postgres-init), Redis, Kafka\n(KRaft mode, no Zookeeper needed), all six Spring Boot services, and\nthe shell + payments/fraud/reconciliation MFEs served via nginx from a\nshared parameterized Dockerfile (infra/angular.Dockerfile builds\nwhichever app APP_NAME names, since NX needs the whole workspace as\nbuild context regardless of which app is being built).\n\nnginx needs an explicit Access-Control-Allow-Origin header for Native\nFederation''s cross-origin remoteEntry.json / chunk loading to work --\nthe dev servers allow this implicitly, plain static hosting doesn''t.\n\n`git clone && docker compose up` now reproduces the whole system per\nthe project''s original goal.","tree":{"sha":"ace93b6f9884160d85f8d58270bd0aef9f71d6f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/ace93b6f9884160d85f8d58270bd0aef9f71d6f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/ebb414cd639f8900da5eebea05dc205b5bc9a1fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/ebb414cd639f8900da5eebea05dc205b5bc9a1fc","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKGViYjQxNGNkNjM5Zjg5MDBkYTVlZWJlYTA1ZGMyMDViNWJjOWExZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/119a3526db0d24eb1b0bdd52f59a69ba719a177c","sha":"119a3526db0d24eb1b0bdd52f59a69ba719a177c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/119a3526db0d24eb1b0bdd52f59a69ba719a177c"}],"sha":"ebb414cd639f8900da5eebea05dc205b5bc9a1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/ebb414cd639f8900da5eebea05dc205b5bc9a1fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/119a3526db0d24eb1b0bdd52f59a69ba719a177c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:45:17Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:45:17Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"feat: add Fraud and Reconciliation microfrontends\n\nFraud MFE: high-risk case list + a detail view matching the mock\nexactly (risk score, factors, Investigate/Block/Approve), backed by\nfraud-service.\n\nReconciliation MFE: MATCHED/MISSING/MISMATCH/DUPLICATE record list\nwith status filtering and an investigation modal, backed by the new\nreconciliation-service (owns reconciliation logic; no mutations yet,\nread-only).\n\nSince each MFE now talks to a different backend with no GraphQL\nGateway in front of them, libs/graphql moves to Apollo Angular''s named\nclients: one Apollo Client per service, split by schema\n(payment/fraud/reconciliation subfolders, each generating its own\ntyped operations). provideGraphQL() takes a list of {name, uri} and\nregisters all of them via provideNamedApollo -- the shell registers\nevery client every routed MFE needs, for the same reason it owns\nGraphQL client registration generally (see previous commits).\n\nlibs/types gains a proper ReconciliationRecord type and drops the\nspeculative Transaction.reconciliation field it superseded. Fraud''s\ntype is reshaped to match fraud-service''s actual flat GraphQL shape.\nui-status-badge''s colour mapping extends to risk levels and\nreconciliation statuses.","tree":{"sha":"bcbad9b248d3343a702ef3aa8197e165e775d41d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/bcbad9b248d3343a702ef3aa8197e165e775d41d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/119a3526db0d24eb1b0bdd52f59a69ba719a177c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/119a3526db0d24eb1b0bdd52f59a69ba719a177c","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKDExOWEzNTI2ZGIwZDI0ZWIxYjBiZGQ1MmY1OWE2OWJhNzE5YTE3N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/5d7cf36a1de8ccd714306c1cec810fe6e7f30461","sha":"5d7cf36a1de8ccd714306c1cec810fe6e7f30461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/5d7cf36a1de8ccd714306c1cec810fe6e7f30461"}],"sha":"119a3526db0d24eb1b0bdd52f59a69ba719a177c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/119a3526db0d24eb1b0bdd52f59a69ba719a177c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/5d7cf36a1de8ccd714306c1cec810fe6e7f30461/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:44:33Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:44:33Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"feat: add kafka event-driven payment flow\n\npayment-service now publishes PaymentCreated to a payment-events topic\nafter a successful create. Two new focused consumers react to it:\nnotification-service (logs what would be a real notification channel)\nand audit-service (persists an append-only audit trail). Each service\nowns its own local copy of the event contract rather than sharing a\nlibrary type across the boundary.\n\nAlso adds fraud-service: consumes PaymentCreated, runs a mock\nrisk-scoring engine (amount-based + randomized factors, seeded per\npayment for stable demo data), and persists a FraudCase with a\nGraphQL API for querying and for investigate/approve/block actions.\n\npayment-service additionally gains: Redis-backed idempotency on\ncreatePayment (duplicate requests with the same key return the\noriginal payment instead of creating a new one), a Redis fixed-window\nrate limiter on the GraphQL endpoint, Actuator health checks, and\nrequest-scoped structured logging (requestId via MDC, correlated\nacross a request''s log lines).","tree":{"sha":"7e2bf7cbebb18e2c29bec74dee5e92c241bd5957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/7e2bf7cbebb18e2c29bec74dee5e92c241bd5957"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/5d7cf36a1de8ccd714306c1cec810fe6e7f30461","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/5d7cf36a1de8ccd714306c1cec810fe6e7f30461","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKDVkN2NmMzZhMWR