\n\nOwns account information: Account entity, GraphQL query API\n(accounts/account/accountByNumber), and a Redis cache-aside layer on\ntop of Postgres for account lookups. Includes Actuator health checks\nand request-scoped structured logging, matching payment-service''s\nobservability setup.","tree":{"sha":"19c7e5e73aa60618d93317394583e153ecc2a53f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/19c7e5e73aa60618d93317394583e153ecc2a53f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/d3d8ba905a095ee0e5c8b4f1c43bb307c60c6026","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/d3d8ba905a095ee0e5c8b4f1c43bb307c60c6026","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKGQzZDhiYTkwNWEwOTVlZTBlNWM4YjRmMWM0M2JiMzA3YzYwYzYwMjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/343c55055dc32b80786c2a0aaf8031a872eb9b84","sha":"343c55055dc32b80786c2a0aaf8031a872eb9b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/343c55055dc32b80786c2a0aaf8031a872eb9b84"}],"sha":"d3d8ba905a095ee0e5c8b4f1c43bb307c60c6026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/d3d8ba905a095ee0e5c8b4f1c43bb307c60c6026"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/343c55055dc32b80786c2a0aaf8031a872eb9b84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T11:18:17Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T11:18:17Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"feat: add GraphQL layer and payment-service backend\n\nIntroduces the first backend service: payment-service (Spring Boot,\nJava 21, Spring for GraphQL, Spring Data JPA) with controller/service/\nrepository/model/dto/exception/config layers, a GraphQL schema, and\nPostgreSQL persistence via docker-compose (`docker compose up` starts\nboth). No dedicated GraphQL Gateway yet -- payment-service is the only\nbackend service so far, and Apollo Client talks to it directly.\n\nFrontend: libs/graphql now holds real queries/mutations/fragments with\nGraphQL Code Generator producing typed Apollo Angular operations\n(split into base-types.ts + graphql.ts to work around a known\ntypescript-operations v6 bug). The Payments MFE''s PaymentsService is\nrewired from its in-memory mock onto Apollo Client. provideGraphQL()\nis registered in both the payments app''s own config and the shell''s,\nsince Native Federation mounts remote routes into the shell''s injector\nvia loadChildren -- provider registrations in the remote''s own config\nnever apply once federated in.\n\nVerified end-to-end: creating a payment from the UI persists to\nPostgreSQL and survives a hard page refresh via a fresh GraphQL fetch.","tree":{"sha":"c4fe9276f71ce2b8d828041a481d7be94b3a9262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/c4fe9276f71ce2b8d828041a481d7be94b3a9262"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/343c55055dc32b80786c2a0aaf8031a872eb9b84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/343c55055dc32b80786c2a0aaf8031a872eb9b84","node_id":"C_kwDOUfO9YNoAKDM0M2M1NTA1NWRjMzJiODA3ODZjMmEwYWFmODAzMWE4NzJlYjliODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commit/b177ce177035110768556b2a4a962bc224364b8b","sha":"b177ce177035110768556b2a4a962bc224364b8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/b177ce177035110768556b2a4a962bc224364b8b"}],"sha":"343c55055dc32b80786c2a0aaf8031a872eb9b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/343c55055dc32b80786c2a0aaf8031a872eb9b84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163878803?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VanshikaWadhwa17","id":163878803,"login":"VanshikaWadhwa17","node_id":"U_kgDOCcSXkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VanshikaWadhwa17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/commits/b177ce177035110768556b2a4a962bc224364b8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T23:35:27Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T23:35:27Z","email":"vansforbusiness@gmail.com","name":"Vanshika Wadhwa"},"message":"feat: build first vertical slice — shell -> payments MFE\n\nShared ui library (button, card, table<T>, modal, status-badge, spinner,\nempty-state, error-state) consumed by the Payments MFE. Payments MFE gets\nreal routing (list/detail/create) exposed via Native Federation and\nmounted into the shell with loadChildren, a mock PaymentsService (RxJS),\nsignals-based list state, route-param-bound detail view (signals +\nrxjs-interop), and a typed Reactive Form for creation.\n\nAlso adds a mocked authentication architecture: Role/Permission/User\ndomain types, a signal-based AuthService with role->permission mapping,\nand a /login page with role-aware header state in the shell. Frontend\nauth is intentionally mocked — real authorization will be enforced by\nSpring Boot services later.","tree":{"sha":"7f73719e18723d73f1d84e80ba9633064374b6ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/trees/7f73719e18723d73f1d84e80ba9633064374b6ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VanshikaWadhwa17/Enterprise-Payments-Platform/git/commits/b177ce177035110768556b2a4a962bc224364b8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuse